/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Batuktech/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Batuktech","id":149748717,"login":"Batuktech","node_id":"U_kgDOCOz77Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Batuktech/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Batuktech/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Batuktech/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Batuktech/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Batuktech/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Batuktech","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awise-svg/ERXES/commits/2eceda20c09c45bed72f991c2f052eab6e5a4b0b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T04:36:38Z","email":"batuukka@gmail.com","name":"Batuk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T04:36:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(erxes-api-shared): SaaS plan-history assistant-limit read helpers (#8503)\n\n* feat(erxes-api-shared): SaaS plan-history assistant-limit read helpers\n\nAdds the shared SaaS billing primitives that agent_api (erxes-private)\nreads to enforce per-tenant AI-assistant limits:\n\n- types.ts: ISaasBundle + ISaasOrganizationPlanHistory (incl.\n  assistantLimit, pluginsLimitsSnapshot); IOrganization gains\n  _id/isNext/bundleId.\n- definition.ts: saasOrganizationPlanHistorySchema\n  (organization_plan_histories) with assistantLimit + timestamps.\n- saas-mongo-connection.ts: coreModelOrganizationPlanHistories,\n  getSaasOrganizationPlanHistories (bundle-joined), and a guard in\n  getSaasCoreConnection so an empty/invalid CORE_MONGO_URL throws\n  catchably instead of crashing the process via an unhandled\n  connection ''error'' event.\n- index.ts: export the saas types.\n\nCore-side of the AI-assistant limit feature; the agent_api/agent_ui\nconsumers live in erxes-private and pick these up via the shared-lib\nsync.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in c645b35 according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/8503","tree":{"sha":"38a81a3117eab0a4b17a03c0e6d8d8c9fa126ed8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awise-svg/ERXES/git/trees/38a81a3117eab0a4b17a03c0e6d8d8c9fa126ed8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/awise-svg/ERXES/git/commits/2eceda20c09c45bed72f991c2f052eab6e5a4b0b","verification":{"payload":"tree 38a81a3117eab0a4b17a03c0e6d8d8c9fa126ed8\nparent 5226b03d8775472e77f1a3d3884d6c5439bc03d4\nauthor Batuk <batuukka@gmail.com> 1782966998 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782966998 +0800\n\nfeat(erxes-api-shared): SaaS plan-history assistant-limit read helpers (#8503)\n\n* feat(erxes-api-shared): SaaS plan-history assistant-limit read helpers\n\nAdds the shared SaaS billing primitives that agent_api (erxes-private)\nreads to enforce per-tenant AI-assistant limits:\n\n- types.ts: ISaasBundle + ISaasOrganizationPlanHistory (incl.\n  assistantLimit, pluginsLimitsSnapshot); IOrganization gains\n  _id/isNext/bundleId.\n- definition.ts: saasOrganizationPlanHistorySchema\n  (organization_plan_histories) with assistantLimit + timestamps.\n- saas-mongo-connection.ts: coreModelOrganizationPlanHistories,\n  getSaasOrganizationPlanHistories (bundle-joined), and a guard in\n  getSaasCoreConnection so an empty/invalid CORE_MONGO_URL throws\n  catchably instead of crashing the process via an unhandled\n  connection ''error'' event.\n- index.ts: export the saas types.\n\nCore-side of the AI-assistant limit feature; the agent_api/agent_ui\nconsumers live in erxes-private and pick these up via the shared-lib\nsync.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in c645b35 a