ps://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rjrodger","id":138608,"login":"rjrodger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODYwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/voxgig-sdk/vercel-sdk/commits/89287f5ff54cfc7fe02c28134113d2308fad9f83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T11:21:28Z","email":"richard@ricebridge.com","name":"Richard Rodger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T11:21:28Z","email":"richard@ricebridge.com","name":"Richard Rodger"},"message":"Regenerate on sdkgen 4.30.2 / apidef 8.17.2\n\nRegenerated from the repo''s own OpenAPI definition in .sdk/def against:\n@voxgig/sdkgen 4.30.2, @voxgig/apidef 8.17.2, @voxgig/model 12.0.0, @voxgig/docgen 0.29.0, jostraca 0.39.0, shape 11.4.1, aontu 0.76.0\n\nWhat this sweep changes, beyond regenerating from the current templates:\n\nEntity names derived from a -ses collection path. apidef now derives `base`\nfrom /bases where it derived `bas`: the -ses rule removes -es, which is right\nwhen the stem itself ends in s (classes, statuses, ip_addresses) and wrong when\nit ends in se, and five words were missing from the table that separates them.\nA repo whose paths have no such segment is unaffected.\n\nPackage manifests. sdkName appends -sdk unless the slug already carries it, so\na manifest that read @<origin>/<slug> now reads @<origin>/<slug>-sdk. The older\nrule keyed off the origin and left the suffix off. No cedar package is\npublished; the git tag is the release surface.\n\nStale generated files. Generation writes and never deletes, so an entity that\napidef no longer derives left its client behind: bluefin-decryptx-p2pe carried\nDeviceListEntity and DeviceCustodyListEntity for entities the model dropped,\nand ts would not compile against types that no longer exist. This sweep removes\nevery tracked file under each target directory and lets generation re-author\nthem, so what is committed is what the toolchain now produces.\n\nGenerated by @voxgig/sdkgen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013d9RiV1oM6qtQJZ3T3etRZ","tree":{"sha":"b5d7238103e28f61ceaad6ff8a0b84636621e5e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/voxgig-sdk/vercel-sdk/git/trees/b5d7238103e28f61ceaad6ff8a0b84636621e5e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/voxgig-sdk/vercel-sdk/git/commits/89287f5ff54cfc7fe02c28134113d2308fad9f83","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rjrodger","id":138608,"login":"rjrodger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODYwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/voxgig-sdk/vercel-sdk/commit/89287f5ff54cfc7fe02c28134113d2308fad9f83","node_id":"C_kwDOT-r8ztoAKDg5Mjg3ZjVmZjU0Y2ZjN2ZlMDJjMjgxMzQxMTNkMjMwOGZhZDlmODM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/voxgig-sdk/vercel-sdk/commit/5e4bfcf3e8d97d99230a67f45301bb3e4c375f18","sha":"5e4bfcf3e8d97d99230a67f45301bb3e4c375f18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/voxgig-sdk/vercel-sdk/commits/5e4bfcf3e8d97d99230a67f45301bb3e4c375f18"}],"sha":"89287f5ff54cfc7fe02c28134113d2308fad9f83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/voxgig-sdk/vercel-sdk/commits/89287f5ff54cfc7fe02c28134113d2308fad9f83"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rjrodger","id":138608,"login":"rjrodger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzODYwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rjrodger","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/voxgig-sdk/vercel-sdk/commits/5e4bfcf3e8d97d99230a67f45301bb3e4c375f18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T19:09:06Z","email":"richard@ricebridge.com","name":"Richard Rodger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T19:09:06Z","email":"richard@ricebridge.com","name":"Richard Rodger"},"message":"Regenerate the Vercel SDK over the full API: 70 entities\n\nGenerated from the vendor spec (299 paths). Regenerated with FRESH=1 