{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/97a6ab8e039b6771ca5bf07f04b1bbf87380d63a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:08:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:08:56Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Algoritmos diferenciais: a seção e o primeiro algoritmo, neoplasias oncocíticas do rim\n\nNova ferramenta na categoria de diagnóstico diferencial, parente menor e mais\npreciso do Marker Helper: cada algoritmo cobre uma situação só, com as\nperguntas que importam nela. É um algoritmo vivo: o patologista responde o\nque tem, na ordem que quiser (clínica, morfologia, imuno, molecular), a lista\nde candidatos se reordena a cada resposta, a ferramenta aponta a pergunta que\nmais separa os candidatos do topo, e o esquema do algoritmo clássico acende\nos ramos compatíveis com as respostas.\n\nMotor genérico (types.ts, match.ts): perguntas com opções fechadas, entidades\nque classificam cada opção como típica, comum, possível, rara ou nunca;\npontuação por soma de log-verossimilhanças, próximo passo por ganho de\ninformação esperado, ramos com estado ativo, parcial, aberto ou fechado.\n\nPrimeiro conteúdo: 18 entidades (oncocitoma, cromófobo eosinofílico, LOT,\nEVT, FLCN/BHD, SDH, ESC, eAML, FH, ALK, PRNRP, tubulocístico, TLFCK, células\nclaras e papilar eosinofílicos, TFE3, TFEB, doença cística adquirida) e 34\nperguntas, a partir de Trpkov, Siadat & Saleeb (Histopathology 2026), das\natualizações da GUPS (Mod Pathol 2021), Amin et al. e Hes & Trpkov (Mod\nPathol 2022) e da OMS 2022.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016weBkU1FfZ5jSCeVNMqqWU","tree":{"sha":"7538466637bbe965f8513f861c04ca30e01a0061","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/7538466637bbe965f8513f861c04ca30e01a0061"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/97a6ab8e039b6771ca5bf07f04b1bbf87380d63a","verification":{"payload":"tree 7538466637bbe965f8513f861c04ca30e01a0061\nparent 7c7d3c0d0b29e970c8aee86f541ea8a22a80fe3d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790946536 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790946536 +0000\n\nAlgoritmos diferenciais: a seção e o primeiro algoritmo, neoplasias oncocíticas do rim\n\nNova ferramenta na categoria de diagnóstico diferencial, parente menor e mais\npreciso do Marker Helper: cada algoritmo cobre uma situação só, com as\nperguntas que importam nela. É um algoritmo vivo: o patologista responde o\nque tem, na ordem que quiser (clínica, morfologia, imuno, molecular), a lista\nde candidatos se reordena a cada resposta, a ferramenta aponta a pergunta que\nmais separa os candidatos do topo, e o esquema do algoritmo clássico acende\nos ramos compatíveis com as respostas.\n\nMotor genérico (types.ts, match.ts): perguntas com opções fechadas, entidades\nque classificam cada opção como típica, comum, possível, rara ou nunca;\npontuação por soma de log-verossimilhanças, próximo passo por ganho de\ninformação esperado, ramos com estado ativo, parcial, aberto ou fechado.\n\nPrimeiro conteúdo: 18 entidades (oncocitoma, cromófobo eosinofílico, LOT,\nEVT, FLCN/BHD, SDH, ESC, eAML, FH, ALK, PRNRP, tubulocístico, TLFCK, células\nclaras e papilar eosinofílicos, TFE3, TFEB, doença cística adquirida) e 34\nperguntas, a partir de Trpkov, Siadat & Saleeb (Histopathology 2026), das\natualizações da GUPS (Mod Pathol 2021), Amin et al. e Hes & Trpkov (Mod\nPathol 2022) e da OMS 2022.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016weBkU1FfZ5jSCeVNMqqWU\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKxW1rNP\n3Kfu1CUUATZLwDwH2cLflQjCyXK/Yerw2T/Ld/LuTIMTo+arN59zgIEmi8OFosmkYkQ3EHrKaa/P\nDQg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T13:08:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/97a6ab8e039b6771ca5bf07f04b1bbf87380d63a","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDk3YTZhYjhlMDM5YjY3NzFjYTViZjA3ZjA0YjFiYmY4NzM4MGQ2M2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/7c7d3c0d0b29e970c8aee86f541ea8a22a80fe3d","sha":"7c7d3c0d0b29e970c8aee86f541ea8a22a80fe3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/7c7d3c0d0b29e970c8aee86f541ea8a22a80fe3d"}],"sha":"97a6ab8e039b6771ca5bf07f04b1bbf87380d63a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/97a6ab8e039b6771ca5bf07f04b1bbf87380d63a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/7c7d3c0d0b29e970c8aee86f541ea8a22a80fe3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:35:47Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:35:47Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: as últimas lacunas de cabeça e pescoço, salivares, rim e SNC\n\nFecha a lista de lacunas contra a OMS. São 515 tumores.\n\nCabeça e pescoço: cisto odontogênico calcificante com tumor dentinogênico\nde células fantasmas, cementoblastoma com osteoblastoma dos maxilares, e\ntumores ceruminosos da orelha externa.\n\nSalivares e tireoide: sialoblastoma, queratocistoma com adenomas de ducto\nestriado e intercalado, e teratoma da tireoide.\n\nRim, bexiga e adrenal: carcinoma renal associado a doença cística\nadquirida, mielolipoma adrenal, tumor de células justaglomerulares, e\ncistite cística e glandular com os demais mímicos benignos da bexiga.\n\nSNC: tumor neuronal multinodular e vacuolizante com liponeurocitoma\ncerebelar, glioma cordoide do terceiro ventrículo, sarcoma intracraniano\nDICER1-mutante, e ependimoma mixopapilar.\n\nTeste de fumaça final sem erro de console: próstata glandular lobular dá\natrofia 100% com adenose 45% e adenocarcinoma 30%; esôfago epitelioide\nS100+ CD117- dá tumor de células granulares 100%; mama fusocelular\ninfiltrativa com queratina negativa devolve o diferencial inteiro de\nlesão fusocelular mamária.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"32a366869885ed7fd42b3052e6ade05f188f52c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/32a366869885ed7fd42b3052e6ade05f188f52c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/7c7d3c0d0b29e970c8aee86f541ea8a22a80fe3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/7c7d3c0d0b29e970c8aee86f541ea8a22a80fe3d","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDdjN2QzYzBkMGIyOWU5NzBjOGFlZTg2ZjU0MWVhOGEyMmE4MGZlM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/fa194eaf4d1ac0e177894b56b72ed406ab109a17","sha":"fa194eaf4d1ac0e177894b56b72ed406ab109a17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/fa194eaf4d1ac0e177894b56b72ed406ab109a17"}],"sha":"7c7d3c0d0b29e970c8aee86f541ea8a22a80fe3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/7c7d3c0d0b29e970c8aee86f541ea8a22a80fe3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/fa194eaf4d1ac0e177894b56b72ed406ab109a17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:30:56Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:30:56Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: próstata e testículo (+8), tubo digestivo (+5) e mama (+6)\n\nSão 501 tumores.\n\nPróstata, testículo e pênis: neoplasia intraepitelial peniana,\nmesotelioma da túnica vaginal, tumor de cordão sexual não classificado\ncom ginandroblastoma, tumores da rete testis com cistadenoma do\nepidídimo, lipossarcoma do cordão espermático, tumor de restos adrenais\ntesticulares, carcinoma verrucoso peniano, e atrofia prostática com\natrofia proliferativa inflamatória.\n\nTubo digestivo: tumor de células granulares esofágico, displasia\nassociada a doença inflamatória intestinal, pólipo de glândulas fúndicas\ncom pólipo hiperplásico, lipoma e hemangioma da parede, e adenocarcinoma\nserrilhado com adenoescamoso.\n\nMama: fibromatose mamária, hamartoma com ginecomastia, carcinoma\nsecretor, carcinoma adenoide cístico, variantes de células ricas em\nlipídios, glicogênio e oncocítica, e necrose gordurosa com mastites.\n\nQuatro entram como mímicos que já geraram cirurgia a mais: a atrofia\nparcial da próstata é AMACR positiva com camada basal descontínua; o\nlipossarcoma do cordão é operado como lipoma ou hérnia; a fibromatose\nmamária retrai a pele como carcinoma; e histiócitos espumosos em nódulo\npalpável já foram laudados como carcinoma de células claras.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b5ff0d346e270c3489e63be18e7a19e41a9382e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/5b5ff0d346e270c3489e63be18e7a19e41a9382e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/fa194eaf4d1ac0e177894b56b72ed406ab109a17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/fa194eaf4d1ac0e177894b56b72ed406ab109a17","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKGZhMTk0ZWFmNGQxYWMwZTE3Nzg5NGI1NmI3MmVkNDA2YWIxMDlhMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/f11afca5943ad6b68e72af709078072a482eb4f6","sha":"f11afca5943ad6b68e72af709078072a482eb4f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/f11afca5943ad6b68e72af709078072a482eb4f6"}],"sha":"fa194eaf4d1ac0e177894b56b72ed406ab109a17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/fa194eaf4d1ac0e177894b56b72ed406ab109a17"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/f11afca5943ad6b68e72af709078072a482eb4f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:25:08Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:25:08Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: pele (+11) e hematolinfoide (+14)\n\nSão 482 tumores.\n\nPele: nevo displásico, tumores de Spitz (nevo, melanocitoma e melanoma\nspitzoide), melanoma acral com lentigo maligno, queratoacantoma,\nxantogranuloma juvenil, tumor misto cutâneo, carcinoma mucinoso primário,\nadenocarcinoma écrino digital papilífero, tricolemoma com tumor\ntriquilemal proliferante, angioleiomioma com leiomiossarcoma cutâneo, e\nneurotecoma celular com mixoma de bainha nervosa.\n\nHematolinfoide: linfoma de alto grau duplo-hit, DLBCL EBV-positivo com\ngranulomatose linfomatoide, linfoma B rico em células T e histiócitos,\nlinfomas cutâneos primários de células B, ALCL cutâneo com papulose\nlinfomatoide, linfoma T subcutâneo paniculítico, linfoma primário de\nefusão, linfoma T hepatoesplênico, LGL com prolinfocítica T, linfoma T\nindolente do TGI, sarcoma de células dendríticas interdigitantes,\nneoplasias linfoides in situ, Burkitt-símile com aberração de 11q, e as\nlinfadenites que imitam linfoma.\n\nTrês armadilhas de imuno ficaram registradas na nota do marcador: o\nBRAF V600E é positivo na maioria dos nevos comuns e não prova\nmalignidade; o MITF é positivo no neurotecoma celular, que não é\nmelanocítico; e a mieloperoxidase marca os histiócitos de Kikuchi, o que\njá levou a diagnóstico de sarcoma mieloide numa linfadenite benigna.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ccade4fed35dcf673173df304015cc5ba84eea0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/ccade4fed35dcf673173df304015cc5ba84eea0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/f11afca5943ad6b68e72af709078072a482eb4f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/f11afca5943ad6b68e72af709078072a482eb4f6","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKGYxMWFmY2E1OTQzYWQ2YjY4ZTcyYWY3MDkwNzgwNzJhNDgyZWI0ZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/3ef37094a87e436abad6362a6904b9793f5cbc9d","sha":"3ef37094a87e436abad6362a6904b9793f5cbc9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/3ef37094a87e436abad6362a6904b9793f5cbc9d"}],"sha":"f11afca5943ad6b68e72af709078072a482eb4f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/f11afca5943ad6b68e72af709078072a482eb4f6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/3ef37094a87e436abad6362a6904b9793f5cbc9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:17:22Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:17:22Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: partes moles (+15) e osso com bainha neural (+10)\n\nSão 457 tumores.\n\nPartes moles: tumor ossificante fibromixoide, sarcoma intimal,\nhemangioendotelioma kaposiforme com angioma em tufos, tumor glômico\nmaligno, fibrossarcoma tipo lipofibromatose e sarcoma NTRK, sarcoma\nmiofibroblástico epitelioide inflamatório, angiofibroma celular com\nangiomiofibroblastoma, tumor fibro-histiocitário plexiforme, fibromatose\nsuperficial, fibroma de bainha tendínea com fibroma desmoplásico, tumor\nfibroso calcificante, hemangioendotelioma retiforme e composto, variantes\ndo lipoma, condroma de partes moles e elastofibroma.\n\nOsso e bainha neural: fibroma condromixoide, condrossarcoma de células\nclaras e desdiferenciado, osteossarcoma parosteal e periosteal, linfoma\nprimário do osso, schwannoma melanótico, tumor mesenquimal fosfatúrico,\nosteossarcoma telangiectásico e de pequenas células, vasculares do osso,\ntumor marrom do hiperparatireoidismo, e tumor híbrido de bainha nervosa\ncom neuroma traumático.\n\nDois padrões de imuno que só fazem sentido com a nota escrita junto: o\nsarcoma miofibroblástico epitelioide inflamatório tem ALK nuclear ou\nperinuclear (RANBP2), e não citoplasmático como o clássico; e o\nschwannoma melanótico coexpressa SOX10 com HMB-45, sendo o colágeno IV\npericelular o que o separa do melanoma.\n\nO tumor marrom entra sabendo que é indistinguível do tumor de células\ngigantes na lâmina: a nota diz que a resposta está na dosagem sérica de\nPTH, e que o H3.3 G34W é o único marcador que ajuda.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ca7bd8b7ed5ecaeb2a6416c2806cd3128d9131b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/6ca7bd8b7ed5ecaeb2a6416c2806cd3128d9131b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/3ef37094a87e436abad6362a6904b9793f5cbc9d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/3ef37094a87e436abad6362a6904b9793f5cbc9d","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDNlZjM3MDk0YTg3ZTQzNmFiYWQ2MzYyYTY5MDRiOTc5M2Y1Y2JjOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/7b05c0ff9a7d859510eb590f2f738d756c1a8619","sha":"7b05c0ff9a7d859510eb590f2f738d756c1a8619","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/7b05c0ff9a7d859510eb590f2f738d756c1a8619"}],"sha":"3ef37094a87e436abad6362a6904b9793f5cbc9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/3ef37094a87e436abad6362a6904b9793f5cbc9d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/7b05c0ff9a7d859510eb590f2f738d756c1a8619/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:10:03Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:10:03Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: tórax (+10) e fígado com pâncreas (+11)\n\nSão 432 tumores.\n\nTórax: subtipos de timoma A a B3, tumores de tipo glândula salivar do\nbrônquio, carcinoma adenoescamoso, mesotelioma in situ com papilar bem\ndiferenciado, adenoma bronquiolar, DIPNECH com tumorlets, hamartoma\npulmonar, fibroelastoma papilar com rabdomioma cardíaco, esôfago de\nBarrett com displasia, e hiperplasia com cisto tímico.\n\nFígado e pâncreas: carcinoma combinado hepatocelular-colangiocarcinoma,\nneoplasia papilar intraductal biliar, hemangioma hepático, carcinoma\nindiferenciado com células gigantes osteoclásticas, adenoma de ducto\nbiliar com complexo de von Meyenburg, ITPN e IOPN, sarcoma embrionário\nindiferenciado, hemangioma infantil hepático, neoplasia mucinosa cística\nhepatobiliar, cisto linfoepitelial e carcinoma adenoescamoso do pâncreas.\n\nO verbete de timoma passa a cobrir os cinco subtipos, com a nota de que\na proporção de timócitos TdT positivos é o eixo da distinção — e de que\nTdT em massa mediastinal não significa linfoma linfoblástico antes de\nprocurar a rede epitelial com p63 e CK19.\n\nTrês entram como mímicos que levam a cirurgia desnecessária: o adenoma\nbronquiolar tem camada basal p40 contínua e vira adenocarcinoma na\ncongelação; o adenoma de ducto biliar é nódulo subcapsular que o\ncirurgião manda como suspeita de metástase; e as células gigantes do\ncarcinoma pancreático osteoclástico são reativas, CD68 positivas e\nqueratina negativas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51073137da4edcda6b5e0e846cd19a133f3333ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/51073137da4edcda6b5e0e846cd19a133f3333ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/7b05c0ff9a7d859510eb590f2f738d756c1a8619","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/7b05c0ff9a7d859510eb590f2f738d756c1a8619","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDdiMDVjMGZmOWE3ZDg1OTUxMGViNTkwZjJmNzM4ZDc1NmMxYTg2MTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/108aa0f32250c5889e8571e2c68bcf3ccd46f41a","sha":"108aa0f32250c5889e8571e2c68bcf3ccd46f41a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/108aa0f32250c5889e8571e2c68bcf3ccd46f41a"}],"sha":"7b05c0ff9a7d859510eb590f2f738d756c1a8619","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/7b05c0ff9a7d859510eb590f2f738d756c1a8619"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/108aa0f32250c5889e8571e2c68bcf3ccd46f41a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:03:57Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T23:03:57Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: ovário (+13) e útero com colo e vulva (+10)\n\nContinuando a lista de lacunas por sistema. São 411 tumores.\n\nOvário: teratoma imaturo, tumor mucinoso borderline, cistadenomas seroso\ne mucinoso, struma ovarii com carcinoide estrumal, carcinossarcoma,\ntumor de células esteroides, tumor seromucinoso, tumor estromal\nesclerosante, tumor de cordão sexual com túbulos anulares,\ngonadoblastoma, tumor wolffiano (FATWO), borderline endometrioide e de\ncélulas claras, e fibrossarcoma ovariano.\n\nÚtero, colo e vulva: carcinoma neuroendócrino do colo, adenocarcinoma\nmesonéfrico e mesonéfrico-símile, carcinoma mucinoso do endométrio,\nneoplasia intraepitelial vulvar, UTROSCT, sarcoma uterino indiferenciado,\nleiomiomatose intravenosa com leiomioma metastatizante, rabdomiossarcoma\nbotrioide do colo, nódulo de sítio placentário com sítio placentário\nexagerado, e adenose vaginal com carcinoma de células claras.\n\nTrês entram sobretudo pelo perfil contraintuitivo, que é onde a\nferramenta ajuda mais: o adenocarcinoma mesonéfrico é GATA3 e TTF-1\npositivo com ER negativo num tumor ginecológico; o struma ovarii é TTF-1\ne tireoglobulina positivo sem ser metástase de tireoide; e o nódulo de\nsítio placentário é p63 positivo como o tumor trofoblástico epitelioide,\nsendo o Ki-67 o único critério que os separa.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d2ea313fe7c15e3d49be494ad72a39ddbb65fec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/7d2ea313fe7c15e3d49be494ad72a39ddbb65fec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/108aa0f32250c5889e8571e2c68bcf3ccd46f41a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/108aa0f32250c5889e8571e2c68bcf3ccd46f41a","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDEwOGFhMGYzMjI1MGM1ODg5ZTg1NzFlMmM2OGJjZjNjY2Q0NmY0MWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/fadd04cb2703245aa75cb59fb895f72e5f226191","sha":"fadd04cb2703245aa75cb59fb895f72e5f226191","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/fadd04cb2703245aa75cb59fb895f72e5f226191"}],"sha":"108aa0f32250c5889e8571e2c68bcf3ccd46f41a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/108aa0f32250c5889e8571e2c68bcf3ccd46f41a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/fadd04cb2703245aa75cb59fb895f72e5f226191/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:57:16Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:57:16Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: cabeça e pescoço (+13) e salivares com tireoide (+11)\n\nPrioridade média da lista de lacunas, indo por sistema em vez de por\ngrupo temático. Eram os dois mais atrasados. São 388 tumores.\n\nCabeça e pescoço: papiloma escamoso com papilomatose respiratória\nrecorrente, carcinoma sinonasal multifenotípico HPV-relacionado,\nadenocarcinoma sinonasal não intestinal, carcinoma linfoepitelial fora\nda nasofaringe, tumor de Pindborg, tumor odontogênico adenomatoide,\nfibroma ameloblástico com odontoma, lesões fibro-ósseas dos maxilares,\ngranuloma central de células gigantes, hamartoma adenomatoide epitelial\nrespiratório, tumores neuroendócrinos da laringe, as variantes basaloide\ne verrucosa do carcinoma escamoso, e tumor do saco endolinfático.\n\nSalivares e tireoide: carcinoma de células claras hialinizante,\noncocitoma salivar, adenoma de células basais, mioepitelioma, carcinoma\nintraductal salivar, adenocarcinoma microsecretor, adenoma policístico\nesclerosante, tumor trabecular hialinizante, neoplasias foliculares de\npotencial maligno incerto, CASTLE e hiperplasia de paratireoide.\n\nVários existem justamente para evitar sobretratamento, e a nota do\nmarcador diz isso: o tumor trabecular hialinizante tem sulcos e\npseudoinclusões que fazem a punção virar papilífero, e o que o denuncia\né o MIB-1 com marcação de membrana; o carcinoma sinonasal\nmultifenotípico é MYB positivo sem ter a fusão MYB::NFIB, e tem\nprognóstico bem melhor que o adenoide cístico que ele copia; o CASTLE é\nCD5 positivo e sobrevive muito mais que o anaplásico com que é\nconfundido.\n\nTestado: boca de células claras p40+ S100- dá hialinizante 100% com\nmucoepidermoide 96%; tireoide escamosa TTF-1- CD117+ dá CASTLE 68% com\nanaplásico em 5%.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2008d43239c3ab1aa9674e3b6150bf42c785bb19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/2008d43239c3ab1aa9674e3b6150bf42c785bb19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/fadd04cb2703245aa75cb59fb895f72e5f226191","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/fadd04cb2703245aa75cb59fb895f72e5f226191","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKGZhZGQwNGNiMjcwMzI0NWFhNzVjYjU5ZmI4OTVmNzJlNWYyMjYxOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/e90be3aa013dce60fe15cda53bf1d30f6e33e9a9","sha":"e90be3aa013dce60fe15cda53bf1d30f6e33e9a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/e90be3aa013dce60fe15cda53bf1d30f6e33e9a9"}],"sha":"fadd04cb2703245aa75cb59fb895f72e5f226191","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/fadd04cb2703245aa75cb59fb895f72e5f226191"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/e90be3aa013dce60fe15cda53bf1d30f6e33e9a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:46:07Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:46:07Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: SNC pediátrico com região pineal (13) e medula óssea (3)\n\nQuarto e quinto lotes da lista de lacunas. São 364 tumores, e com isso\nos cinco grupos de prioridade alta estão fechados.\n\nSNC: ATRT, subependimoma, astrocitoma subependimário de células gigantes,\ntumor neuroepitelial disembrioplásico, glioma hemisférico difuso H3 G34,\nglioma hemisférico do lactente, gliomas difusos pediátricos de baixo grau\n(MYB/MYBL1, PLNTY, angiocêntrico, MAPK), astrocitoma de alto grau com\ncaracterísticas piloides, tumores do parênquima pineal, ETMR com\nneuroblastoma FOXR2, a família selar TTF-1 positiva, tumores\nmelanocíticos meníngeos e meduloepitelioma do corpo ciliar.\n\nMedula óssea: leucemia mieloide aguda, síndromes mielodisplásicas e\nneoplasias mieloproliferativas. Escritos com a ressalva explícita nos\ncritérios de que ali o diagnóstico é de morfologia somada a citogenética\ne molecular, e a imuno é coadjuvante — conta blastos, revela o\nmegacariócito displásico e reconhece o subgrupo TP53.\n\nDois marcadores novos no vocabulário, porque sem eles esses verbetes não\nse escrevem: CD61 (megacariócitos, que o hematoxilina-eosina esconde) e\nH3.3 G34R/V. Este último é clone distinto do G34W do tumor de células\ngigantes do osso, e a nota diz isso, porque confundi-los seria erro.\n\nTestado com o roteiro de fumaça: encéfalo rabdoide com INI1 perdido dá\nATRT em 100% com tumor rabdoide do rim em 55%; sela fusocelular TTF-1+\nsinaptofisina- dá a família da neuro-hipófise em 100% e o adenoma cai\npara 1%; pineal de células pequenas com sinaptofisina e calcificação dá\nparênquima pineal 100%, neurocitoma 46%, ETMR 36%.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a9831a513919c439ebf9f7534e0b2d6ee4ce4d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/0a9831a513919c439ebf9f7534e0b2d6ee4ce4d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/e90be3aa013dce60fe15cda53bf1d30f6e33e9a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/e90be3aa013dce60fe15cda53bf1d30f6e33e9a9","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKGU5MGJlM2FhMDEzZGNlNjBmZTE1Y2RhNTNiZjFkMzBmNmUzM2U5YTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/e331f0ea8188d68f4c29cf48c9c57f193c9623da","sha":"e331f0ea8188d68f4c29cf48c9c57f193c9623da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/e331f0ea8188d68f4c29cf48c9c57f193c9623da"}],"sha":"e90be3aa013dce60fe15cda53bf1d30f6e33e9a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/e90be3aa013dce60fe15cda53bf1d30f6e33e9a9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/e331f0ea8188d68f4c29cf48c9c57f193c9623da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:37:15Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:37:15Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: mímicos benignos (12) e o rim da 5ª edição (13)\n\nSegundo e terceiro lotes da lista de lacunas. São 348 tumores.\n\nMímicos benignos, o grupo que a ferramenta não podia propor porque só\ntinha lesão maligna: adenose esclerosante e cicatriz radial, papiloma\nintraductal e miofibroblastoma na mama; nódulo estromal endometrial e\npólipo endometrial com hiperplasia sem atipia no útero; hiperplasia\nprostática benigna e carcinoma intraductal da próstata; hiperplasia\nendotelial papilar intravascular (Masson); displasia fibrosa com fibroma\nnão ossificante, cisto ósseo simples e tumor notocordal benigno no osso;\ne schwannoma gastrointestinal.\n\nRim, que é onde a 5ª edição mais mudou: tumor renal papilar de células\nclaras (hoje benigno), MTSCC, tubulocístico, eosinofílico sólido e\ncístico, SDH-deficiente, TFEB-alterado, ALK-rearranjado, ELOC-mutado,\nLOT e EVT, tumor rabdoide do rim, papiloma urotelial com PUNLMP, adenoma\nmetanéfrico e tumor misto epitelial e estromal.\n\nTrês desses verbetes existem justamente para evitar cirurgia a mais: o\ntumor notocordal benigno é braquiúria positivo como o cordoma, o tumor\nrenal papilar de células claras deixou de ser carcinoma em 2022, e o\ncarcinoma renal tubulocístico tem nucléolo grau 3 com comportamento\nindolente.\n\nTestado com o roteiro de fumaça:\n- rim células claras CK7+ CD117-: papilar 100%, tumor papilar de células\n  claras 60%, ELOC 24%, e o de células claras clássico cai para 6%.\n- rim oncocítico CK20+ CK7-: eosinofílico sólido e cístico 92%,\n  oncocitoma 81%.\n- estômago fusocelular S100+ CD117-: schwannoma gastrointestinal 100%.\n- mama glandular infiltrativa ER+ com calcificação: adenose esclerosante\n  100%, carcinoma luminal 95%, tubular 57% — o diferencial real.\n- próstata cribriforme com necrose: acinar 100%, intraductal 45%, PIN 27%.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a9fefdf4663f5e2e89f5fb8e9caf64ba6fc728ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/a9fefdf4663f5e2e89f5fb8e9caf64ba6fc728ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/e331f0ea8188d68f4c29cf48c9c57f193c9623da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/e331f0ea8188d68f4c29cf48c9c57f193c9623da","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKGUzMzFmMGVhODE4OGQ2OGY0YzI5Y2Y0OGM5YzU3ZjE5M2M5NjIzZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/20343b49cd87724d1911f863ed13b5219548cf1d","sha":"20343b49cd87724d1911f863ed13b5219548cf1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/20343b49cd87724d1911f863ed13b5219548cf1d"}],"sha":"e331f0ea8188d68f4c29cf48c9c57f193c9623da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/e331f0ea8188d68f4c29cf48c9c57f193c9623da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/20343b49cd87724d1911f863ed13b5219548cf1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:25:35Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:25:35Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: os precursores, que faltavam em sete sistemas\n\nPrimeiro lote da lista de lacunas contra a OMS. O catálogo tinha quase\nsó lesão invasora, então a ferramenta nunca podia propor o precursor —\ne é ele que decide conduta em boa parte das biópsias.\n\nEntram 11 verbetes: ceratose actínica; adenoma folicular de tireoide;\nadenocarcinoma in situ, minimamente invasivo e hiperplasia adenomatosa\natípica do pulmão; carcinoma lobular in situ com hiperplasia lobular\natípica; atipia epitelial plana e lesões de células colunares; adenoma\ncolorretal convencional; lesões serrilhadas do cólon; displasia e\nadenoma gástricos; neoplasia intraepitelial pancreática (PanIN); lesão\nintraepitelial escamosa do colo (LSIL e HSIL); e adenocarcinoma in situ\nendocervical. São 323 tumores.\n\nCada um declara o painel do próprio sítio, inclusive CD45 negativo,\nseguindo a convenção do commit b9c2a68.\n\nTestado com o roteiro de fumaça, e a graduação da barra ficou informativa\nem vez de binária:\n- colo escamoso p16+ Ki-67+ mitoses moderadas: LSIL/HSIL 100%, carcinoma\n  escamoso 28%, adenocarcinoma in situ 3%.\n- cólon glandular CDX2+ CK7- com precursor adjacente: adenoma 100%,\n  adenocarcinoma 82%, lesões serrilhadas 71% — o diferencial real.\n- pulmão glandular TTF-1+ p40- mitoses raras: pré-invasor 100%,\n  adenocarcinoma invasor 19%; foi o índice mitótico que separou.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"019d1d8104c9597e974d1b86a760258a650cc3b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/019d1d8104c9597e974d1b86a760258a650cc3b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/20343b49cd87724d1911f863ed13b5219548cf1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/20343b49cd87724d1911f863ed13b5219548cf1d","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDIwMzQzYjQ5Y2Q4NzcyNGQxOTExZjg2M2VkMTNiNTIxOTU0OGNmMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/c7922191cf262fa3b84d4427c290b090e8cab341","sha":"c7922191cf262fa3b84d4427c290b090e8cab341","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/c7922191cf262fa3b84d4427c290b090e8cab341"}],"sha":"20343b49cd87724d1911f863ed13b5219548cf1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/20343b49cd87724d1911f863ed13b5219548cf1d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/c7922191cf262fa3b84d4427c290b090e8cab341/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:06:03Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T22:06:03Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: a barra passa a medir plausibilidade, não posição na lista\n\nA barra era a posição relativa entre o pior e o melhor da lista, então o\nsegundo colocado aparecia quase cheio mesmo quando a imuno já o tinha\nexcluído. Com CD45 positivo e pan-queratina negativa numa lesão de\ntireoide, os carcinomas ficavam entre 32 e 43% da barra.\n\nComo a pontuação é uma soma de log-verossimilhanças, exp(pontuação −\nmelhor) é a razão de verossimilhança contra o primeiro colocado, e é\nisso que a barra passa a mostrar, com o número ao lado. No mesmo caso,\nos carcinomas caem para menos de 1%, e a barra fica cinza abaixo de 10%\npara não sugerir concorrência que não existe.\n\nEm caso comum a graduação continua informativa: pulmão glandular com\nTTF-1 positivo e p40 negativo dá 100%, 23%, 13%, 13%, 13%.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f07474e05eea2a25979b06cceda456b553a316e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/2f07474e05eea2a25979b06cceda456b553a316e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/c7922191cf262fa3b84d4427c290b090e8cab341","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/c7922191cf262fa3b84d4427c290b090e8cab341","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKGM3OTIyMTkxY2YyNjJmYTNiODRkNDQyN2MyOTBiMDkwZThjYWIzNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/b9c2a687267535c5282bce35162c2d33eb11c4d7","sha":"b9c2a687267535c5282bce35162c2d33eb11c4d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/b9c2a687267535c5282bce35162c2d33eb11c4d7"}],"sha":"c7922191cf262fa3b84d4427c290b090e8cab341","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/c7922191cf262fa3b84d4427c290b090e8cab341"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/b9c2a687267535c5282bce35162c2d33eb11c4d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T21:59:49Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T21:59:49Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: declara os negativos de linhagem que faltavam nos painéis\n\nMarcador ausente vale ln(0,5), então o verbete que não declara um\nmarcador não é penalizado por ele. Na prática isso premiava a omissão: o\ntumor de linhagem estranha ao sítio flutuava para o topo porque ninguém\nlhe cobrava o painel daquele sítio.\n\nDuas correções, ambas de conteúdo:\n\n1. Painéis cruzados em 29 verbetes (+116 marcadores). São os de linhagem\n   mesenquimal, linfoide ou trofoblástica que moram em sítio epitelial, e\n   o inverso. O linfoma MALT agora declara TTF-1, tireoglobulina e PAX8\n   negativos; o tumor miofibroblástico inflamatório da bexiga declara\n   p63, GATA3 e queratinas; o hemangioendotelioma epitelioide do fígado\n   declara arginase e HepPar-1; o tumor de células granulares declara p40\n   negativo, com a nota de que quem marca é a hiperplasia\n   pseudoepiteliomatosa suprajacente.\n\n2. CD45 negativo em todos os 237 verbetes não hematolinfoides que o\n   omitiam. Eram 84% dos epiteliais e 92% dos mesenquimais. Sem isso, o\n   \"é linfoma?\" só elevava os linfomas, sem derrubar ninguém.\n\nMedido antes e depois, com o mesmo roteiro:\n- bexiga fusocelular p40+ GATA3+: o rabdomiossarcoma embrionário e o\n  tumor miofibroblástico inflamatório ocupavam a 2ª e a 3ª posição;\n  agora saíram do top 5, que ficou com urotelial invasivo, in situ e\n  escamoso.\n- olho pequenas redondas S100- sinaptofisina+: o rabdomiossarcoma\n  embrionário era o 1º e o retinoblastoma o 2º; agora inverteram.\n\nPainel médio por verbete: de 14,0 para 15,1 marcadores.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f038574301e61b5be8a4df82e9b48d0f718d8342","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/f038574301e61b5be8a4df82e9b48d0f718d8342"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/b9c2a687267535c5282bce35162c2d33eb11c4d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/b9c2a687267535c5282bce35162c2d33eb11c4d7","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKGI5YzJhNjg3MjY3NTM1YzUyODJiY2UzNTE2MmMyZDMzZWIxMWM0ZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/7d9ee0c11e4aa7c078064e293620952d9111e429","sha":"7d9ee0c11e4aa7c078064e293620952d9111e429","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/7d9ee0c11e4aa7c078064e293620952d9111e429"}],"sha":"b9c2a687267535c5282bce35162c2d33eb11c4d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/b9c2a687267535c5282bce35162c2d33eb11c4d7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/7d9ee0c11e4aa7c078064e293620952d9111e429/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T21:45:11Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T21:45:11Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: confere uma amostra das porcentagens contra a literatura\n\nPrimeira passagem de verificação: 12 pares tumor × marcador de alto\nimpacto, escolhidos por serem os que mais movem o ranking e os que,\nerrados, mudariam a faixa de leitura. Oito precisaram de ajuste.\n\nCorrigidos, com a fonte agora gravada no próprio par:\n- TTF-1 em adenocarcinoma pulmonar, de 75-85 para 65-85. O clone\n  8G7G3/1 fica entre 65 e 82% nas séries comparativas, e o SPT24 chega\n  a cerca de 85%, não a 90%.\n- HepPar-1 em hepatocarcinoma, de 80-90 para 70-90: a queda nos pouco\n  diferenciados é para 46%, contra 86% da arginase.\n- CA-IX em carcinoma renal de células claras, de 90-100 para 85-95.\n- CAMTA1 em hemangioendotelioma epitelioide, de 85-95 para 80-90, com\n  a nota de que os negativos costumam ter YAP1::TFE3.\n- ERG em adenocarcinoma prostático, de 40-55 para 35-50, com a ressalva\n  de que a frequência cai muito em homens de ascendência africana.\n- STAT6 em tumor fibroso solitário, de 90-100 para 95-100 (98% na série\n  original de Doyle).\n- p53 em seroso de alto grau, de 90-100 para 95-100, com a nota de que\n  cerca de 4% têm TP53 mutado e imuno selvagem.\n- MYB em adenoide cístico: faixa mantida, com o aviso de que as séries\n  vão de 26 a 97% conforme o clone e o ponto de corte.\n\nConferidos e confirmados sem mudança: TRPS1 em mama triplo-negativa,\nSATB2 em colorretal, perda de INI1 em sarcoma epitelioide, perda de\nSMAD4 em adenocarcinoma pancreático, arginase-1 em hepatocarcinoma e\nNKX3.1 em adenocarcinoma prostático.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5831a43ae007ac2540c632ee1a3893acc86b55c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/5831a43ae007ac2540c632ee1a3893acc86b55c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/7d9ee0c11e4aa7c078064e293620952d9111e429","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/7d9ee0c11e4aa7c078064e293620952d9111e429","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDdkOWVlMGMxMWU0YWE3YzA3ODA2NGUyOTM2MjA5NTJkOTExMWU0Mjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/8c9835240da436672a2568537242c3784b8c3b28","sha":"8c9835240da436672a2568537242c3784b8c3b28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/8c9835240da436672a2568537242c3784b8c3b28"}],"sha":"7d9ee0c11e4aa7c078064e293620952d9111e429","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/7d9ee0c11e4aa7c078064e293620952d9111e429"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/8c9835240da436672a2568537242c3784b8c3b28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T21:41:14Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T21:41:14Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: engrossa partes moles (+11) e hematolinfoide (+13)\n\nPartes moles ganha lipoblastoma, hibernoma, fibro-histiocitoma\nangiomatoide, sarcoma fibroblástico mixoinflamatório, sarcoma\nepitelioide esclerosante, condrossarcoma mixoide extraesquelético,\nhemangioendotelioma pseudomiogênico, hemangioma epitelioide, miofibroma\ne miopericitoma, malformação linfática e angiomixoma agressivo.\n\nHematolinfoide ganha linfoplasmacítico, zona marginal esplênica,\ntricoleucemia, B mediastinal primário, primário do SNC, plasmablástico,\nATLL, T intestinal (EATL e MEITL), B intravascular, Castleman, BPDCN,\nsarcoma histiocítico e Erdheim-Chester. São 312 tumores no total.\n\nO sarcoma sinovial passa a declarar CD31 e ERG negativos. Sem isso ele\nsubia acima do hemangioendotelioma pseudomiogênico num caso epitelioide\nCD31 positivo e queratina positiva, porque marcador ausente não penaliza\ne o tumor que informa honestamente 50 a 70% de CD31 acabava perdendo\npara o que não informava nada.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d6b734a9a20bc4e5fa53af069c2c0a727cd25c1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/d6b734a9a20bc4e5fa53af069c2c0a727cd25c1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/8c9835240da436672a2568537242c3784b8c3b28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/8c9835240da436672a2568537242c3784b8c3b28","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDhjOTgzNTI0MGRhNDM2NjcyYTI1Njg1MzcyNDJjMzc4NGI4YzNiMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/1f4875515fea1668fd43057680d2790f40b690dd","sha":"1f4875515fea1668fd43057680d2790f40b690dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/1f4875515fea1668fd43057680d2790f40b690dd"}],"sha":"8c9835240da436672a2568537242c3784b8c3b28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/8c9835240da436672a2568537242c3784b8c3b28"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/1f4875515fea1668fd43057680d2790f40b690dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T21:14:09Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T21:14:09Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: os nove sistemas que faltavam (154 verbetes)\n\nFecha o catálogo: cabeça e pescoço (17), salivares, tireoide e\nparatireoide (19), fígado, vias biliares e pâncreas (15), rim, via\nurinária e adrenal (18), próstata, testículo e pênis (16), ovário e\ntuba (15), útero, colo e doença trofoblástica (17), sistema nervoso,\nhipófise e olho (17) e hematolinfoide (20). São 288 tumores no total.\n\nAcrescenta MUC6 ao vocabulário de marcadores, usado no adenocarcinoma\nendocervical de tipo gástrico e no IPMN.\n\nValidado contra o vocabulário fechado (zero ids desconhecidos,\nporcentagens dentro da faixa, sem marcador repetido no mesmo tumor),\ntsc e eslint limpos, e um teste de fumaça por sistema confirmando a\nordenação: tireoide+TTF-1+/PAX8+ dá papilífero; salivar basaloide\nCD117+/p40+ dá adenoide cístico; rim claras PAX8+/CK7- dá carcinoma\nde células claras; linfonodo grandes discoesas CD45+/queratina- dá\nlinfoma difuso de grandes células B.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"66654c84cb213fb3b19ec775801fbc0747074af9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/66654c84cb213fb3b19ec775801fbc0747074af9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/1f4875515fea1668fd43057680d2790f40b690dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/1f4875515fea1668fd43057680d2790f40b690dd","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDFmNDg3NTUxNWZlYTE2NjhmZDQzMDU3NjgwZDI3OTBmNDBiNjkwZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/6e401040cd0d647b6eb05a44b110a489ab3e7a21","sha":"6e401040cd0d647b6eb05a44b110a489ab3e7a21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/6e401040cd0d647b6eb05a44b110a489ab3e7a21"}],"sha":"1f4875515fea1668fd43057680d2790f40b690dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/1f4875515fea1668fd43057680d2790f40b690dd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/6e401040cd0d647b6eb05a44b110a489ab3e7a21/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T20:21:22Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T20:21:22Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: mama (17) e tubo digestivo (21)\n\nOs dois juntos fecham o painel de origem mais pedido: uma metástase\nhepática ou nodal agora cai no diagnóstico certo com CK7, CK20, CDX2,\nSATB2, GATA3, TRPS1 e TTF-1.\n\nMama: os três subtipos por perfil (luminal, HER2-positivo e\ntriplo-negativo, este com TRPS1 e SOX10 para quando GATA3 falha), lobular\ncom E-caderina e p120, proliferações intraductais com o painel\nmioepitelial que prova invasão, mucinoso, tubular, metaplásico, apócrino,\nmicropapilar com polaridade invertida, papilar, Paget do mamilo,\nfibroadenoma e filoide, neuroendócrino, adenomioepitelioma, adenose\nmicroglandular e hiperplasia estromal pseudoangiomatosa.\n\nTubo digestivo: gástrico intestinal e difuso, hepatoide, colorretal e\nmedular, apendiculares (LAMN e células caliciformes), delgado e ampola,\nneuroendócrinos separados por sítio (gástrico, íleo, apêndice, reto) com\no que os distingue entre si, carcinoma neuroendócrino, anais, e os\nmesenquimais da parede: GIST, leiomioma, glômico, fibroide inflamatório,\nfibromixoma plexiforme e o carcinoma SWI/SNF-deficiente.\n\nVerificado: tsc limpo, ids conferidos, e no smoke test \"fígado +\nglandular + CDX2+ / CK7− / TTF-1−\" o adenocarcinoma colorretal vem em\nprimeiro, como metástase.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"937d14c5bcfe6577ba973f8c1fb5298ec5039286","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/937d14c5bcfe6577ba973f8c1fb5298ec5039286"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/6e401040cd0d647b6eb05a44b110a489ab3e7a21","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/6e401040cd0d647b6eb05a44b110a489ab3e7a21","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDZlNDAxMDQwY2QwZDY0N2I2ZWIwNWE0NGIxMTBhNDg5YWIzZTdhMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/4f769eee29a0257223556967f538eaa846b56e75","sha":"4f769eee29a0257223556967f538eaa846b56e75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/4f769eee29a0257223556967f538eaa846b56e75"}],"sha":"6e401040cd0d647b6eb05a44b110a489ab3e7a21","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/6e401040cd0d647b6eb05a44b110a489ab3e7a21"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/4f769eee29a0257223556967f538eaa846b56e75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T20:06:48Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T20:06:48Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: 19 tumores do tórax\n\nPulmão, pleura, mediastino, coração e esôfago: o bloco que mais aparece na\nimuno da rotina.\n\n- Pulmão: adenocarcinoma e a variante mucinosa invasiva em verbetes\n  separados, porque esta é TTF-1 negativa com CK20 e CDX2 positivos e é o\n  erro clássico de \"metástase gastrointestinal\"; espinocelular, pequenas\n  células, neuroendócrino de grandes células, carcinoide, sarcomatoide,\n  tumor SMARCA4-deficiente, blastoma pleuropulmonar e adenocarcinoma fetal.\n- Pleura: mesotelioma epitelioide e sarcomatoide, com os dois painéis do\n  consenso (calretinina, WT1, D2-40, CK5/6 contra claudina-4, MOC-31,\n  BerEP4, CEA) e as perdas de BAP1 e MTAP que provam malignidade.\n- Mediastino: timoma, carcinoma tímico e tumor neuroendócrino tímico, com\n  CD5 e CD117 nas epiteliais como a chave entre os dois primeiros.\n- Coração: mixoma e sarcoma primário. Esôfago: adenocarcinoma de Barrett e\n  espinocelular.\n\nO cabeçalho do arquivo avisa que o clone de TTF-1 muda o resultado: as\nfaixas assumem 8G7G3/1, e o SPT24 é mais sensível e menos específico.\n\nVerificado: tsc limpo, ids conferidos, e nos smoke tests \"pulmão +\nglandular + TTF-1+ / p40−\" dá adenocarcinoma pulmonar em primeiro e\n\"pleura + epitelioide + CK7+ / TTF-1−\" dá mesotelioma epitelioide.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3823f5c0576924161061c905b931d855d5d2ed57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/3823f5c0576924161061c905b931d855d5d2ed57"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/4f769eee29a0257223556967f538eaa846b56e75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/4f769eee29a0257223556967f538eaa846b56e75","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDRmNzY5ZWVlMjlhMDI1NzIyMzU1Njk2N2Y1MzhlYWE4NDZiNTZlNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/78b12504c6cb0f266118f308b4c70904f5e02e51","sha":"78b12504c6cb0f266118f308b4c70904f5e02e51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/78b12504c6cb0f266118f308b4c70904f5e02e51"}],"sha":"4f769eee29a0257223556967f538eaa846b56e75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/4f769eee29a0257223556967f538eaa846b56e75"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/78b12504c6cb0f266118f308b4c70904f5e02e51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T19:53:37Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T19:53:37Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: 24 tumores de osso, bainha neural e células redondas\n\nFecha a área de partes moles com o que faltava:\n\n- Células pequenas e redondas: Ewing (CD99 membranoso com NKX2.2), CIC\n  (WT1, ETV4, DUX4), BCOR (BCOR, CCNB3, SATB2), DSRCT (desmina em dot com\n  WT1 e queratina) e tumor rabdoide (perda de INI1).\n- Neuroblásticos e paragânglios: neuroblastoma e ganglioneuroma com PHOX2B\n  e tirosina hidroxilase; feocromocitoma e paraganglioma com GATA3,\n  queratina negativa e a perda de SDHB que muda o seguimento da família.\n- Bainha neural: schwannoma (S100 difusa), neurofibroma (S100 parcial com\n  CD34 em rede), MPNST (S100 focal com perda de H3K27me3) e perineurioma\n  (EMA e claudina-1 com S100 negativa).\n- Osso: osteossarcoma, condrossarcoma com o encondroma que o mímica,\n  condrossarcoma mesenquimal, condroblastoma (H3.3 K36M), tumor de células\n  gigantes (H3.3 G34W), cisto ósseo aneurismático, osteocondroma, osteoma\n  osteoide, cordoma (braquiúria) e adamantinoma.\n\nCD99 e miogenina entraram no painel rápido, que não os tinha e são dos\nmais pedidos nesses tumores.\n\nVerificado: tsc limpo, ids conferidos por script, e no smoke test \"osso +\ncélulas pequenas redondas + CD99+ / desmina− / CD45−\" a lista sai Ewing,\nCIC, BCOR, sinovial e condrossarcoma mesenquimal, nessa ordem.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8afc5109080bc8aba3be55f85bceebbafa6bee51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/8afc5109080bc8aba3be55f85bceebbafa6bee51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/78b12504c6cb0f266118f308b4c70904f5e02e51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/78b12504c6cb0f266118f308b4c70904f5e02e51","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDc4YjEyNTA0YzZjYjBmMjY2MTE4ZjMwOGI0YzcwOTA0ZjVlMDJlNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/9a12ab015d5f1450365ed8f0d60955400db5bb6c","sha":"9a12ab015d5f1450365ed8f0d60955400db5bb6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/9a12ab015d5f1450365ed8f0d60955400db5bb6c"}],"sha":"78b12504c6cb0f266118f308b4c70904f5e02e51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/78b12504c6cb0f266118f308b4c70904f5e02e51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/9a12ab015d5f1450365ed8f0d60955400db5bb6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T19:36:32Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T19:36:32Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: 29 tumores de partes moles, e fontes que existem de verdade\n\nPartes moles: lipomatosos (com MDM2/CDK4 e RB1), musculares, sarcoma\nsinovial, tumor fibroso solitário, desmoide, fasciite nodular, tumor\nmiofibroblástico inflamatório, sarcoma epitelioide, alveolar de partes\nmoles, células claras, vasculares (CAMTA1, FOSB, MYC, HHV-8), tumor\nglômico, PEComa, UPS, mixofibrossarcoma, MUC4, tenossinovial de células\ngigantes, mixoma e tumor de células granulares.\n\nTambém conserta um defeito do commit anterior: 31 das 48 URLs citadas na\npele não existiam ou apontavam para o capítulo errado do StatPearls. As 17\nque resolvem e batem com o tema ficaram; as demais viraram citação de\nlivro, e a tela agora mostra fonte sem link como texto, não como link\nquebrado. As fontes de partes moles são referências de texto (WHO 5ª ed.,\nEnzinger & Weiss, artigos citados por autor e revista).\n\nVerificado: tsc limpo, todos os ids do vocabulário conferidos por script,\ne no smoke test \"partes moles + fusocelular + CD34+ / desmina− / S100−\" o\ntumor fibroso solitário vem em primeiro, com STAT6, MDM2 e MUC4 entre os\nmarcadores sugeridos a seguir.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f947547cfa7d5e0c1af3c79c8f74b48f8e644fda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/f947547cfa7d5e0c1af3c79c8f74b48f8e644fda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/9a12ab015d5f1450365ed8f0d60955400db5bb6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/9a12ab015d5f1450365ed8f0d60955400db5bb6c","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDlhMTJhYjAxNWQ1ZjE0NTAzNjVlZDhmMGQ2MDk1NTQwMGRiNWJiNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/982b4a01d727d1c19c9208ad0fa7d1dadb5f8656","sha":"982b4a01d727d1c19c9208ad0fa7d1dadb5f8656","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/982b4a01d727d1c19c9208ad0fa7d1dadb5f8656"}],"sha":"9a12ab015d5f1450365ed8f0d60955400db5bb6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/9a12ab015d5f1450365ed8f0d60955400db5bb6c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/982b4a01d727d1c19c9208ad0fa7d1dadb5f8656/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T16:40:29Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T16:40:29Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Marker Helper: sítio, morfologia e imuno em diagnósticos ordenados\n\nA ferramenta responde à pergunta da bancada: tumor em tal lugar, com tal\ncara, marcou isto e não marcou aquilo — o que é, e o que peço a seguir.\n\n- types.ts: vocabulário fechado (49 sítios, 29 tipos celulares, 22\n  arquiteturas, 38 achados com três níveis de índice mitótico e necrose,\n  328 marcadores com padrão esperado e leitura) e o tipo Tumor, em que\n  cada par tumor × marcador guarda a porcentagem da literatura, o padrão,\n  uma ressalva e a fonte.\n- match.ts: pontuação por soma de log-verossimilhanças. Positivo num\n  marcador que só 10% marcam custa caro; negativo num que 95% marcam custa\n  mais ainda; sem dado vale ln(0,5), para ninguém lucrar com ignorância.\n  Sítio, morfologia, idade e sexo entram como prior. Também calcula o\n  ganho de informação de cada marcador ainda não pedido, para dizer o que\n  pedir a seguir, e monta a comparação lado a lado.\n- A tela mostra, para cada diagnóstico, marcador a marcador, o que bate, o\n  que não bate e o que bate por exceção, com os critérios, os mímicos, as\n  armadilhas e o perfil completo.\n- Conteúdo: 24 tumores da pele. Os outros 14 sistemas ficam como arquivos\n  vazios, para entrar aos poucos no mesmo formato.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"43ec3aa7d331c33e837d7f4f0550ffe626514387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/43ec3aa7d331c33e837d7f4f0550ffe626514387"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/982b4a01d727d1c19c9208ad0fa7d1dadb5f8656","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/982b4a01d727d1c19c9208ad0fa7d1dadb5f8656","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDk4MmI0YTAxZDcyN2QxYzE5YzkyMDhhZDBmYTdkMWRhZGI1Zjg2NTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/c