om/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/0ffddb690f5aab8342ba2118f6b99c3fb541177b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T23:21:03Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T23:21:03Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Cyst namer: rank common cysts first and fold the digit inclusion cyst into the epidermoid\n\nEach entry now carries a frequency (3 comum, 2 padrão, 1 raro) that\nnudges the score by ±1 and breaks ties, so for skin plus keratinizing\nsquamous the epidermoid cyst comes before rarities; the cards show a\n\"comum\" or \"raro\" tag. The post-traumatic epidermal inclusion cyst\nof the digit was the same cyst with a different address, so it lives\ninside the epidermoid entry now.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7504cc2d0269ed149891766a20463d75e9130565","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/7504cc2d0269ed149891766a20463d75e9130565"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/0ffddb690f5aab8342ba2118f6b99c3fb541177b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/0ffddb690f5aab8342ba2118f6b99c3fb541177b","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDBmZmRkYjY5MGY1YWFiODM0MmJhMjExOGY2Yjk5YzNmYjU0MTE3N2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/fdf5e82498adabab1c136da523cd41f493e0768f","sha":"fdf5e82498adabab1c136da523cd41f493e0768f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/fdf5e82498adabab1c136da523cd41f493e0768f"}],"sha":"0ffddb690f5aab8342ba2118f6b99c3fb541177b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/0ffddb690f5aab8342ba2118f6b99c3fb541177b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/fdf5e82498adabab1c136da523cd41f493e0768f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:29:26Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T22:29:26Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Add the cyst namer: site plus lining in, cyst names out\n\nNew tool at /tools/cistos, activating the \"Name that cyst\" placeholder.\nThe pathologist clicks a region on a body figure (or the list), picks the\nexact site, ticks the lining seen on the slide and any wall or contents\nfindings, and gets the possible cysts ranked, each one saying why it\nappeared (site, lining, findings) and opening into the precise lining,\nwall, contents, where and in whom, clues, look-alikes and sources. A name\nsearch shortcuts the steps.\n\nContent is code, like the catalogues: about 120 entries across skin and\nbone, head and neck (WHO 2022 odontogenic terminology), thorax and breast,\nabdomen, pelvis and genitals, CNS and eye, each lining checked against\npublic references cited in the entry; pseudocysts are flagged as such.\nThe DEV build warns on any site, lining or finding id missing from the\nvocabulary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4e6f22c7a19206ada4ea5864a8e996775f79754","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/f4e6f22c7a19206ada4ea5864a8e996775f79754"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/fdf5e82498adabab1c136da523cd41f493e0768f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/fdf5e82498adabab1c136da523cd41f493e0768f","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKGZkZjVlODI0OThhZGFiYWIxYzEzNmRhNTIzY2Q0MWY0OTNlMDc2OGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/446eca3058ae10adbe731bb774290820f5bd4e88","sha":"446eca3058ae10adbe731bb774290820f5bd4e88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/446eca3058ae10adbe731bb774290820f5bd4e88"}],"sha":"fdf5e82498adabab1c136da523cd41f493e0768f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/fdf5e82498adabab1c136da523cd41f493e0768f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/446eca3058ae10adbe731bb774290820f5bd4e88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T17:52:34Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T17:52:34Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Keep breast lesions inside the specimen and make the cassette plan visual\n\nThe specimen is a rounded superellipsoid but lesions were only clamped to\nits bounding box, so a lesion near a corner floated outside the tissue in\nthe 3D model. The surface now lives in geometry.ts, shared with the model;\ncontainCenter pushes the whole ellipsoid under it, containLesions holds the\ninvariant on every map write and on load, and the mesh''s own vertices are\nclipped to the surface so spicules touch the ink instead of poking through.\n\nMargin distances no longer chase the model: what the pathologist types is\nkept as the measurement (spicules and ill-defined edges beat the geometry),\ntyping one no longer moves the lesion, and clearing a field goes back to the\nmodel value.\n\nCassettes: a second lesion continues the specimen''s letter with the running\nnumber (A7, not B1) instead of taking a new letter, the extra cassettes\ncontinue it too, the pathologist picks which slice was mapped instead of the\nsystem always taking the largest cross-section, and the whole plan is drawn\n— the mapped slice with its inked margins, the lesion and the labelled grid.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"601793cfdbda2cd31d9c4d4534a6df0de185c90b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/601793cfdbda2cd31d9c4d4534a6df0de185c90b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/446eca3058ae10adbe731bb774290820f5bd4e88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/446eca3058ae10adbe731bb774290820f5bd4e88","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDQ0NmVjYTMwNThhZTEwYWRiZTczMWJiNzc0MjkwODIwZjViZDRlODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/d824347e380024d2ecf0fe51bf4aed1df12d1fed","sha":"d824347e380024d2ecf0fe51bf4aed1df12d1fed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/d824347e380024d2ecf0fe51bf4aed1df12d1fed"}],"sha":"446eca3058ae10adbe731bb774290820f5bd4e88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/446eca3058ae10adbe731bb774290820f5bd4e88"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/d824347e380024d2ecf0fe51bf4aed1df12d1fed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T17:07:46Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T17:07:46Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Fill the macroscopy manual''s gastrointestinal system with 15 bench routines\n\nBiópsias endoscópicas, pólipos, mucosectomia/ESD, esofagectomia,\ngastrectomia (câncer e sleeve), enterectomia, apendicectomia, colectomia,\nreto (mesorreto e planos da amputação), cólon não tumoral, canal anal,\nvesícula, fígado e duodenopancreatectomia, each written as ordered steps\nin the manual''s richtext dialect: reception and orientation, inking,\nopening and fixation, measurements, blocks, a model description and the\nusual traps. Built from the CAP protocols, RCPath G049, the AAPA appendix\nguideline, the UChicago gross manual and the SERPAT-HCRP manual.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"328525cba05e4ee6e30ddc615f8192931904d6fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/328525cba05e4ee6e30ddc615f8192931904d6fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/d824347e380024d2ecf0fe51bf4aed1df12d1fed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/d824347e380024d2ecf0fe51bf4aed1df12d1fed","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKGQ4MjQzNDdlMzgwMDI0ZDJlY2YwZmU1MWJmNGFlZDFkZjEyZDFmZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/7b2d181c7d1969c2d730a99aa50633eabd1ee6ec","sha":"7b2d181c7d1969c2d730a99aa50633eabd1ee6ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/7b2d181c7d1969c2d730a99aa50633eabd1ee6ec"}],"sha":"d824347e380024d2ecf0fe51bf4aed1df12d1fed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/d824347e380024d2ecf0fe51bf4aed1df12d1fed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/7b2d181c7d1969c2d730a99aa50633eabd1ee6ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:31:57Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T16:31:57Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Fill the catalogues: 52 bugs and 48 foreign bodies with licensed photos\n\nEntries written from the literature, one to seven photos each, all from\nWikimedia Commons / CDC PHIL under free licences (CC BY, CC BY-SA, CC0,\npublic domain) with the author and licence on every photo. Six bugs are\ntext-only for now (no trustworthy free photo). Facet vocabularies grew to\nmatch. Cards use a 480 px thumbnail; full photos are 1100 px.\n\nscripts/catalog/ holds the generator (Commons API metadata, licence check,\ndownload, credit lines) and the two specs the modules were built from.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"23324a9987ffb50c3b5ccecbd8f71ada6373bb13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/23324a9987ffb50c3b5ccecbd8f71ada6373bb13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/7b2d181c7d1969c2d730a99aa50633eabd1ee6ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/7b2d181c7d1969c2d730a99aa50633eabd1ee6ec","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDdiMmQxODFjN2QxOTY5YzJkNzMwYTk5YWE1MDYzM2VhYmQxZWU2ZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/9163acdf037872cd665c19f82684c423d9b7d8ee","sha":"9163a