lowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/c484d360bda10381bd20b6b55bc7d258ecd7ccae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T11:34:57Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T11:34:57Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Add the bug and foreign-body catalogues with photo submissions\n\nTwo catalogues under \"Diagnóstico diferencial\", content in code like the\nmacroscopy manual (src/tools/catalog/content). Cover with name search and\nfacet filters (morphology, site, clinical for bugs; site and clinical for\nforeign bodies); a profile page per entry with facets and credited photos.\nBoth have a submit modal: the photo is shrunk in the browser and written to\nthe `submissions` collection for curation (create-only rule).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c739da2d45df55e5c5e3a1791ee001cf18d4c3ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/c739da2d45df55e5c5e3a1791ee001cf18d4c3ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/c484d360bda10381bd20b6b55bc7d258ecd7ccae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","s