1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/cc21f6d76761e8d710b24b91e620f68e86d337d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T00:15:11Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T00:15:11Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Add the report archive with categories, tags, favourites and copy counts\n\nPort guimota111/ArquivosLaudos as a per-user tool at /tools/archive: a\ntree of categories under two virtual roots (reports and notes), leaves\nwith free text, tags and an atomic copy counter that sorts siblings by\nuse, favourites, accent-insensitive search over title, text and tags,\ndrag-and-drop moves in an explicit move mode, cascade deletes resolved\non the client, and JSON export/import (also the migration path from the\nstand-alone app). Data lives in users/{uid}/archive with owner-only\nrules, like the case organiser.\n\nThe organiser Modal moves to src/components/ui so both tools share it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3ea7506a8beac4b2b78ec8af6bcb73420b531e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/c3ea7506a8beac4b2b78ec8af6bcb73420b531e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/cc21f6d76761e8d710b24b91e620f68e86d337d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.