//api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/ede5c009a8a499bc2e0867ab110f6239035c3bfb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T15:17:33Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T15:17:33Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Add the field-of-view converter for mitotic counts\n\nNew tool at /tools/fields: derive the field diameter and area of the\nuser''s microscope per objective (from the eyepiece field number, or from\na measured diameter), convert counts between fields and per 1/2/5/10 mm2\nor legacy \"per 10 HPF\" reference fields, and list how many fields each\nCAP/WHO mitotic requirement needs on that microscope. The breast score\nlookup uses the full CAP table (Cree et al. 2021 for the optics).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc8def080216b07c3be3ffd473f34edb77967188","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/bc8def080216b07c3be3ffd473f34edb77967188"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/ede5c009a8a499bc2e0867ab110f6239035c3bfb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/ede5c009a8a499bc2e0867ab110f6239035c3bfb","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKGVkZTVjMDA5YThhNDk5YmMyZTA4NjdhYjExMGY2MjM5MDM1YzNiZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/59d4e768ca0945758c6a482d978c922d3e8d3b33","sha":"59d4e768ca0945758c6a482d978c922d3e8d3b33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/59d4e768ca0945758c6a482d978c922d3e8d3b33"}],"sha":"ede5c009a8a499bc2e0867ab110f6239035c3bfb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/ede5c009a8a499bc2e0867ab110f6239035c3bfb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/59d4e768ca0945758c6a482d978c922d3e8d3b33/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T15:17:33Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T15:17:33Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Add 41 staging calculators derived from the CAP protocols\n\nGenerate one calculator per CAP cancer protocol with a TNM section\n(GI tract, hepatobiliary, pancreas, genitourinary, gynaecologic, thyroid,\nthorax, skin, bone and soft tissue, head and neck), reading the pT/pN/pM\noptions from the current official PDFs. Each file cites the protocol\nversion and keeps the original CAP wording next to every option so the\nPortuguese labels can be checked by the pathologist.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df37665b08c2fd5d656617e8a1a4b51249fa49f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/df37665b08c2fd5d656617e8a1a4b51249fa49f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/59d4e768ca0945758c6a482d978c922d3e8d3b33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/59d4e768ca0945758c6a482d978c922d3e8d3b33","node_id":"C_kwDOT-2Hc9oAKDU5ZDRlNzY4Y2EwOTQ1NzU4YzZhNDgyZDk3OGM5MjJkM2U4ZDNiMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111/Patholytics/commit/66578cd66c8b16b3715b10bb0f12c52cd6f504e9","sha":"66578cd66c8b16b3715b10bb0f12c52cd6f504e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/66578cd66c8b16b3715b10bb0f12c52cd6f504e9"}],"sha":"59d4e768ca0945758c6a482d978c922d3e8d3b33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/59d4e768ca0945758c6a482d978c922d3e8d3b33"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/commits/66578cd66c8b16b3715b10bb0f12c52cd6f504e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T15:17:33Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T15:17:33Z","email":"motag19@yahoo.com","name":"guimota111"},"message":"Port the Estadiador staging calculators and the TMA mapper\n\nBring the 13 pTNM calculators from guimota111/Estadiador into\nsrc/tools/stager, one file per tumour with a shared Calculator contract,\na central registry and a per-field form that renders the staging line\nready to copy. The stage group is computed but hidden (SHOW_STAGE_GROUP).\n\nPort guimota111/tma as src/tools/tma: a core-by-core TMA reader that\nstacks the results for pasting into a spreadsheet column, persisted per\nuser in localStorage.\n\nBoth mount under the signed-in shell (/tools/stager, /tools/tma) and are\nlisted in the tool registry; a new \"workflow\" category hosts the TMA tool.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2649debcc0e3b196f041551421844609299a2f9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/trees/2649debcc0e3b196f041551421844609299a2f9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/guimota111/Patholytics/git/commits/66578cd66c8b16b3715b10bb0f12c52cd6f504e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260088201?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guimota111","id":260088201,"login":"guimota111","node_id":"U_kgDOD4ChiQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guimota111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com