. Each label now takes the cheapest\nspot on or beside its own route that keeps 6px clear of cards, badges and\nother pills. A corridor widens when a straight line across it is too short\nfor its label.\n\nA removed connection with a living end no longer always leaves past the\nlast lane. It takes the direct route when that is cheaper in length plus\ncrossings, and keeps the exile route when the direct one would tangle\nthrough the living graph or leave its label nowhere to sit.\n\nFixes #30","tree":{"sha":"cbf659864758d6ec63c2ec8ec4b85cad9a2f7888","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/git/trees/cbf659864758d6ec63c2ec8ec4b85cad9a2f7888"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/git/commits/6906d3e8903ca83ea49d4eeaafd32d236b658b0a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10930234?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansemmanuel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansemmanuel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansemmanuel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansemmanuel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ohansemmanuel","id":10930234,"login":"ohansemmanuel","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTMwMjM0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansemmanuel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansemmanuel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansemmanuel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansemmanuel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansemmanuel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansemmanuel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commit/6906d3e8903ca83ea49d4eeaafd32d236b658b0a","node_id":"