"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commits/508c2e581ff3ee4887e084929691fd7c792f96a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:13:26Z","email":"fohanekwu@gmail.com","name":"Favour Ohans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:13:26Z","email":"fohanekwu@gmail.com","name":"Favour Ohans"},"message":"🔢 feat(cli): says how many canvases the machine brought with it\n\n`auth login` can now finish the sentence it always wanted to: the app sends\n`claimed` on the token response, so linking reports what it took on.\n\nAbsent and zero stay apart. \"0 canvases are now yours\" is worth saying to\nsomebody who expected some; a store too old to send the number has not told\nus there were none, and gets the sentence that makes no claim either way.","tree":{"sha":"860c2af8ed341dbdb6fcfd9ca7dd8889e1f02d8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/git/trees/860c2af8ed341dbdb6fcfd9ca7dd8889e1f02d8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/git/commits/508c2e581ff3ee4887e084929691fd7c792f96a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46670083?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ohansFavour","id":46670083,"login":"ohansFavour","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcwMDgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commit/508c2e581ff3ee4887e084929691fd7c792f96a5","node_id":"C_kwDOT-8RJNoAKDUwOGMyZTU4MWZmM2VlNDg4N2UwODQ5Mjk2OTFmZDdjNzkyZjk2YTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commit/5360b47c67038161600cd671a25c6a77fc8ea721","sha":"5360b47c67038161600cd671a25c6a77fc8ea721","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commits/5360b47c67038161600cd671a25c6a77fc8ea721"}],"sha":"508c2e581ff3ee4887e084929691fd7c792f96a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commits/508c2e581ff3ee4887e084929691fd7c792f96a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46670083?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ohansFavour","id":46670083,"login":"ohansFavour","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcwMDgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commits/5360b47c67038161600cd671a25c6a77fc8ea721/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:10:14Z","email":"fohanekwu@gmail.com","name":"Favour Ohans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:10:14Z","email":"fohanekwu@gmail.com","name":"Favour Ohans"},"message":"🚪 feat(cli): signs out at the app, and says who you signed in as\n\n`auth logout` forgot the token locally and told nobody, because the only\nrevoke the app exposed was permanent — `DELETE /api/machines/{id}` shuts an\ninstall id out forever, so signing out through it would have cost the machine\nits way back.\n\n`DELETE /api/session` now exists, so logout ends the session first and\nforgets locally whatever it answers. That ordering is the point: somebody\nsigning out of a laptop they are holding cannot be made to wait on a store\nbeing up, so the local half is unconditional and the remote half only decides\nwhether the last line admits the far end does not know yet.\n\n`auth login` names the address, from `GET /api/account`. Asked after the\ncredential is on disk and never before: the sign-in has already happened, and\na greeting that could not be fetched must not make it look as though it had\nnot. A store too old to answer costs the name and nothing else.","tree":{"sha":"0ffc9c2029e808a86d0e9466586c191f5982821e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/git/trees/0ffc9c2029e808a86d0e9466586c191f5982821e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/git/commits/5360b47c67038161600cd671a25c6a77fc8ea721","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46670083?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ohansFavour","id":46670083,"login":"ohansFavour","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcwMDgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commit/5360b47c67038161600cd671a25c6a77fc8ea721","node_id":"C_kwDOT-8RJNoAKDUzNjBiNDdjNjcwMzgxNjE2MDBjZDY3MWEyNWM2YTc3ZmM4ZWE3MjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commit/673f5004e193fa3c613d27c4a4961a8a978f4a00","sha":"673f5004e193fa3c613d27c4a4961a8a978f4a00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commits/673f5004e193fa3c613d27c4a4961a8a978f4a00"}],"sha":"5360b47c67038161600cd671a25c6a77fc8ea721","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commits/5360b47c67038161600cd671a25c6a77fc8ea721"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46670083?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ohansFavour","id":46670083,"login":"ohansFavour","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcwMDgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commits/673f5004e193fa3c613d27c4a4961a8a978f4a00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:38:05Z","email":"fohanekwu@gmail.com","name":"Favour Ohans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:38:05Z","email":"fohanekwu@gmail.com","name":"Favour Ohans"},"message":"🔀 merge: canvas list --remote and canvas claim","tree":{"sha":"b9b80fb224b5f9ef8092af4cadd68296bba52b66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/git/trees/b9b80fb224b5f9ef8092af4cadd68296bba52b66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/git/commits/673f5004e193fa3c613d27c4a4961a8a978f4a00","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46670083?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ohansFavour","id":46670083,"login":"ohansFavour","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcwMDgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commit/673f5004e193fa3c613d27c4a4961a8a978f4a00","node_id":"C_kwDOT-8RJNoAKDY3M2Y1MDA0ZTE5M2ZhM2M2MTNkMjdjNGE0OTYxYThhOTc4ZjRhMDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commit/bf6d57d1659d02f52b80917ff0947f58bb275dd5","sha":"bf6d57d1659d02f52b80917ff0947f58bb275dd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commits/bf6d57d1659d02f52b80917ff0947f58bb275dd5"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commit/9acafcd499803c0489a3376688a743125466a5fe","sha":"9acafcd499803c0489a3376688a743125466a5fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commits/9acafcd499803c0489a3376688a743125466a5fe"}],"sha":"673f5004e193fa3c613d27c4a4961a8a978f4a00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commits/673f5004e193fa3c613d27c4a4961a8a978f4a00"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46670083?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ohansFavour","id":46670083,"login":"ohansFavour","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcwMDgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commits/9acafcd499803c0489a3376688a743125466a5fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:36:15Z","email":"fohanekwu@gmail.com","name":"Favour Ohans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:36:15Z","email":"fohanekwu@gmail.com","name":"Favour Ohans"},"message":"📄 docs(canvas-api): writes down the ownership routes\n\nThe three routes accounts brought — everything an account owns, claiming a\ncanvas, and a fresh write token for an owner who has lost theirs — and the\ncodes they answer with. UNAUTHENTICATED and ALREADY_OWNED are raised here;\nNOT_OWNER, INSTALL_REVOKED and MACHINE_LINKED are in the table because one\nvocabulary owns every code and its status, not because a route on this page\nsends them. All additions, which version 1 permits.\n\nWhat the routes return, rather than what the table implies. The re-grant\nroute answers NOT_FOUND for a canvas that exists and is not yours, honouring\nthe unqualified rule that NOT_FOUND covers exists-but-not-yours, and leaves\nNOT_OWNER to a caller who already knows the thing is real. Claiming is\nwritten down with the check order it actually has, including that an owner\nasking again with a different next token is rotated rather than refused: the\nCLI declines to make that call, and a store implementing this should know the\nroute leaves the decision to its caller.\n\nThe ownership routes are optional, and the page says so where it describes\nthe smallest server that works. Without accounts there is nobody to own\nanything, and everything but `canvas list --remote` and `canvas claim` works\nthe same.","tree":{"sha":"b9b80fb224b5f9ef8092af4cadd68296bba52b66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/git/trees/b9b80fb224b5f9ef8092af4cadd68296bba52b66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/git/commits/9acafcd499803c0489a3376688a743125466a5fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46670083?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ohansFavour","id":46670083,"login":"ohansFavour","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcwMDgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commit/9acafcd499803c0489a3376688a743125466a5fe","node_id":"C_kwDOT-8RJNoAKDlhY2FmY2Q0OTk4MDNjMDQ4OWEzMzc2Njg4YTc0MzEyNTQ2NmE1ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commit/9449ed097dc1ad88803a50605ff341e4e5fa051f","sha":"9449ed097dc1ad88803a50605ff341e4e5fa051f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commits/9449ed097dc1ad88803a50605ff341e4e5fa051f"}],"sha":"9acafcd499803c0489a3376688a743125466a5fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commits/9acafcd499803c0489a3376688a743125466a5fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46670083?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ohansFavour","id":46670083,"login":"ohansFavour","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NjcwMDgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/commits/9449ed097dc1ad88803a50605ff341e4e5fa051f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:36:15Z","email":"fohanekwu@gmail.com","name":"Favour Ohans"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:36:15Z","email":"fohanekwu@gmail.com","name":"Favour Ohans"},"message":"🪪 feat(cli): lists what the account owns, and claims a canvas onto it\n\n`pr-lens canvas list --remote` merges everything the account owns over the\nlocal registry, so a machine that never pushed a canvas still sees it — and\nsees that it cannot edit it. The app keeps only a hash of each write token,\nso owning a canvas and being able to push to it are separate facts, and only\nthe registry can answer the second one. A canvas the app has no title for,\neither because nothing was pushed to it or because the revision would not\nread, is listed under its id: unreadable is a failed read rather than an\nempty canvas, and is never dropped.\n\n`pr-lens canvas claim <id|name>` takes a canvas onto the account this machine\nis signed in to, on the strength of the write token this checkout holds, and\nretires that token in the same step. The rotation is the point rather than\nhousekeeping: possession is the only proof on offer and it rides in every\nedit link ever shared, so leaving the token alive would keep the canvas on\noffer to everyone who was ever sent one. The command warns before it asks.\n\nA second claim is refused rather than quietly rotating again. The app treats\na claim from the owner as a replay and finishes it, which is right for an\nanswer that was lost and wrong for a command run twice, so the CLI asks who\nowns it first and stops there. The token it mints is saved as a pending\nrotation before the request, so an answer that never arrives cannot take it\naway — the next run settles that rotation exactly as `canvas rotate` does,\nand then finds the canvas already its own.\n\n`canvas list --api <url>` narrows the listing to one app, which settles the\nloose end of the shared usage footer advertising a flag the subcommand\nrefused. The environment is read only when the listing is going somewhere:\n$PR_LENS_API_URL names the app to ask and is never a filter, and a malformed\none cannot fail a listing that never leaves the machine.\n\nBoth new paths need an account, and nothing else does. A signed-out\n`canvas list` reads the registry exactly as before, an empty $PR_LENS_TOKEN\nis still not a sign-in, and no write token reaches the terminal in either\nshape — including the one a claim comes back with.","tree":{"sha":"67a94a029d6b1af1f2c21c8b5e95954e26e2c9a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/git/trees/67a94a029d6b1af1f2c21c8b5e95954e26e2c9a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coldteadotai/pr-lens/git/commits/9449ed097dc1ad88803a50605ff341e4e5fa051f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46670083?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ohansFavour/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.githu