e":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfuchs1988","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jfuchs1988/ioBroker.AiAnalytics/commits/cdf93d9d551018f1218ee190d0a727241012ddfd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T12:36:19Z","email":"johannes.fuchs@jfuchs.de","name":"Johannes Fuchs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T12:36:19Z","email":"johannes.fuchs@jfuchs.de","name":"Johannes Fuchs"},"message":"fix: raise license backend timeout and rotate entitlement public key\n\nBoth \"Aktivierung starten\" and every AI chat call were blocked because no\nentitlement token could ever be stored, for two independent reasons found\nvia live debugging on the real Admin UI:\n\n- The license backend''s activation-session request shares the 30s provider\n  timeout, which isn''t enough to cover its cold-start latency. Give the\n  license backend its own 60s timeout in lib/licenseBackend.js instead of\n  raising the shared AI-provider timeout.\n- A backend/Key Vault redeploy regenerated the entitlement-signing-key\n  secret without updating the adapter''s embedded public key, so every\n  issued entitlement failed local signature verification. Re-derived the\n  current public key from the live Key Vault secret and verified it\n  end-to-end against a freshly issued real entitlement before updating\n  main.js.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf65f00bad974b0868d6b8c2195b3e9c8fe671ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jfuchs1988/ioBroker.AiAnalytics/git/trees/bf65f00bad974b0868d6b8c2195b3e9c8fe671ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jfuchs1988/ioBroker.AiAnalytics/git/commits/cdf93d9d551018f1218ee190d0a727241012ddfd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97742746?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfuchs1988/events{/privacy}","followers_