pos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfuchs1988/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfuchs1988/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfuchs1988/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfuchs1988","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jfuchs1988/ioBroker.AiAnalytics/commits/a41faf180f2d5bc820afff1b6ef8fffb4ee5ef5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T22:01:05Z","email":"johannes.fuchs@jfuchs.de","name":"Johannes Fuchs"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T22:01:15Z","email":"johannes.fuchs@jfuchs.de","name":"Johannes Fuchs"},"message":"fix: align license/catalog metadata with evcc-style MIT+limited model\n\nReverts the ADR-0018 decision against official ioBroker catalog inclusion\n(new ADR-0030): the LICENSE file is now unmodified, standard MIT text\n(GitHub was detecting \"other\" instead of MIT due to an appended scope\nclause), package.json and io-package.json license fields are synced to\n\"MIT\", and licenseInformation.type is corrected from \"commercial\" to\n\"limited\" (some functionality requires a paid entitlement, not \"licensed\nonly for commercial use\").\n\nAlso fixes @iobroker/repochecker findings the user hit running the real\nchecker: common.news trimmed to 7 fully-translated entries with a missing\n0.1.3 entry added (E0016/E1017/E1031/E1036/W1054), and adds a GitHub\nActions test workflow (lint/test/admin-build) since the catalog requires\nCI-backed tests (backlog point 5, previously intentionally removed).\n\nProcess rules added in this repo and the backend repo: every master merge\ngoes through a pull request, and every merged PR is always followed by a\nrelease.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a83edf587fefbdddb6d2211ec5677d0afbf21d86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jfuchs1988/ioBroker.AiAnalytics/git/trees/a83edf587fefbdddb6d2211ec5677d0afbf21d8