te":"2026-08-21T01:46:14Z","committedDate":"2026-08-21T01:46:14Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"gonzalomenghi","providerType":"User"},"email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:18:19.231Z","repositoryId":1341253899,"sha":"77b4d5934ca17d73d15918da540096e0035a5821"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"gonzalomenghi","providerType":"User"},"email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-21T00:30:19Z","committedDate":"2026-08-21T00:30:19Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"gonzalomenghi","providerType":"User"},"email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:18:19.231Z","repositoryId":1341253899,"sha":"1c3b233c677a0b1567de4355237247bc06dfd0fe"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"gonzalomenghi","providerType":"User"},"email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-21T00:27:12Z","committedDate":"2026-08-21T00:27:12Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"gonzalomenghi","providerType":"User"},"email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:18:19.231Z","repositoryId":1341253899,"sha":"a13f75c1953de7ed3158b7afb9e0482dcfde8504"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"gonzalomenghi","providerType":"User"},"email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-21T00:22:58Z","committedDate":"2026-08-21T00:22:58Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"gonzalomenghi","providerType":"User"},"email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:18:19.231Z","repositoryId":1341253899,"sha":"b496658df56510cefd2934a58f1a2a62c8976ff9"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"gonzalomenghi","providerType":"User"},"email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-21T00:11:04Z","committedDate":"2026-08-21T00:11:04Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"gonzalomenghi","providerType":"User"},"email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:18:19.231Z","repositoryId":1341253899,"sha":"dbfb7d7eaa8d4768db3f0154686fe4806565d24a"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:18:19.231Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/514fca56fda1011dac1f19cccd3e56c3ec0aa0e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T15:31:04Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T15:31:04Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Defer inventory/price-history commit to an explicit \"Confirmar compra\" step, split real vs. estimated totals\n\n- Checking an item off in Modo Supermercado no longer touches\n  inventario_hogar/precios_historico immediately — it only computes\n  precio_final. \"En el changuito\" is now a staging state, like items\n  sitting in a real cart before checkout.\n- New RPC fn_confirmar_compra_lista(p_lista_id) processes every\n  checked item in one shot (inventory upsert + price history insert)\n  and marks the list ''completada''. Unchecked items are left alone,\n  they don''t block confirming the rest. Same auth.uid()-based\n  ownership check as fn_generar_lista_compra.\n- fn_comprar_item_lista simplifies down to just precio_final\n  bookkeeping across all three comprado transitions, which means\n  detalle_lista.precio_historico_id and the AFTER trigger added in the\n  previous migration to work around its self-referential FK are no\n  longer needed and get dropped — nothing deletes precios_historico\n  rows mid-purchase anymore.\n- Cancelling or deleting a list now never has anything to revert:\n  since nothing hits inventory before confirming, those actions are\n  safe by construction instead of relying on \"purchases already\n  happened, don''t undo them.\"\n- UI: the progress card now shows two figures side by side (\"$X real\"\n  in green, \"$Y estimado\") instead of one blended total, plus a\n  \"Confirmar compra\" button (hidden until at least one item is\n  checked) that opens a summary/confirm modal before calling the RPC\n  and exiting the screen, same flow as cancel/delete.","tree":{"sha":"02c67d372d7d38ff0b253464f797a1942122662d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/02c67d372d7d38ff0b253464f797a1942122662d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/514fca56fda1011dac1f19cccd3e56c3ec0aa0e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/514fca56fda1011dac1f19cccd3e56c3ec0aa0e2","node_id":"C_kwDOT_HpC9oAKDUxNGZjYTU2ZmRhMTAxMWRhYzFmMTljY2NkM2U1NmMzZWMwYWEwZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/6d23d9bdc3349929a2e7f77cb2e509089d5e0646","sha":"6d23d9bdc3349929a2e7f77cb2e509089d5e0646","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/6d23d9bdc3349929a2e7f77cb2e509089d5e0646"}],"sha":"514fca56fda1011dac1f19cccd3e56c3ec0aa0e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/514fca56fda1011dac1f19cccd3e56c3ec0aa0e2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/6d23d9bdc3349929a2e7f77cb2e509089d5e0646/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:51:55Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:51:55Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Fix 3x2/4x3 discount presets not being selectable when editing a list item''s discount\n\nDescuentoPicker fired two separate callbacks (onChangeTipo then\nonChangeValor) on a single preset tap. In ModoSupermercadoScreen, both\nfields live in one combined object built by spreading the same stale\nprop between the two synchronous calls, so the second call clobbered\nthe first — tipo reverted to its old value while only valor updated,\nso the chip never activated. AgregarItemListaModal didn''t show the bug\nsince it uses two independent useState slots there, but list items\n(most commonly the auto-generated ones, which only get edited through\nthis screen and never through that modal) always hit it.\n\nReplaced the two-callback API with a single onChange(tipo, valor) so a\npreset updates both fields in one atomic call.","tree":{"sha":"352b1b24dea6d7a629a7f978a5d4b9672b4e95d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/352b1b24dea6d7a629a7f978a5d4b9672b4e95d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/6d23d9bdc3349929a2e7f77cb2e509089d5e0646","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/6d23d9bdc3349929a2e7f77cb2e509089d5e0646","node_id":"C_kwDOT_HpC9oAKDZkMjNkOWJkYzMzNDk5MjlhMmU3Zjc3Y2IyZTUwOTA4OWQ1ZTA2NDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/349e19055aa482f916f1ad63e227fc1b43a93fab","sha":"349e19055aa482f916f1ad63e227fc1b43a93fab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/349e19055aa482f916f1ad63e227fc1b43a93fab"}],"sha":"6d23d9bdc3349929a2e7f77cb2e509089d5e0646","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/6d23d9bdc3349929a2e7f77cb2e509089d5e0646"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/349e19055aa482f916f1ad63e227fc1b43a93fab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:31:28Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:31:28Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Fix estimated total staying at $0, add revert-purchase and post-purchase price editing to Modo Supermercado\n\n- Price/discount/supermarket edits on a pending item never reached the\n  DB until the item was checked off, so the generated precio_estimado\n  column had nothing to compute from and the running total showed $0\n  despite the input fields having values. Edits now persist live\n  (debounced for the price field).\n- marcarComprado''s optimistic update never refetched on success, so\n  the server-computed precio_final stayed null client-side until some\n  unrelated refetch happened — a freshly bought item could contribute\n  $0 to the total. Now always refetches.\n- Checking an item off is now reversible (mis-taps happen): tapping\n  the filled checkmark reverts it to pending. fn_comprar_item_lista\n  now handles three transitions instead of one — buy, revert (undoes\n  the inventario_hogar increment and removes the precios_historico\n  row it created), and correct (editing price/discount while already\n  bought recalculates precio_final and updates that same\n  precios_historico row in place instead of duplicating it). A new\n  detalle_lista.precio_historico_id column links each purchase to its\n  price-history row so revert/correct can target it precisely; the\n  delete on revert runs in a separate AFTER trigger to avoid a\n  self-referential FK conflict with the BEFORE UPDATE trigger.\n- Purchased items keep their price/discount/supermarket editable\n  (previously read-only) to correct the pre-purchase estimate against\n  the real receipt price.","tree":{"sha":"d19b094da4d89d1b9e66a45d1b9146d1f05b319b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/d19b094da4d89d1b9e66a45d1b9146d1f05b319b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/349e19055aa482f916f1ad63e227fc1b43a93fab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/349e19055aa482f916f1ad63e227fc1b43a93fab","node_id":"C_kwDOT_HpC9oAKDM0OWUxOTA1NWFhNDgyZjkxNmYxYWQ2M2UyMjdmYzFiNDNhOTNmYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/0c924ab089f1c5c059b718a68483bc508cd9fc89","sha":"0c924ab089f1c5c059b718a68483bc508cd9fc89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/0c924ab089f1c5c059b718a68483bc508cd9fc89"}],"sha":"349e19055aa482f916f1ad63e227fc1b43a93fab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/349e19055aa482f916f1ad63e227fc1b43a93fab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/0c924ab089f1c5c059b718a68483bc508cd9fc89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T13:49:57Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T13:49:57Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Fix FAB hidden behind tab bar, add editable quantities and SEPA supermarket suggestions in Modo Supermercado\n\n- ModoSupermercadoScreen''s FAB sat at the same bottom offset as the\n  floating tab bar and was rendering clipped behind it; matches the\n  bottom:86 offset already used elsewhere.\n- Auto-generated shopping list items now have a quantity stepper\n  (cantidad_solicitada was editable in the DB but had no UI for it).\n- SupermercadoPicker suggests real chain names sourced from the SEPA\n  comercio directory as one-tap chips, reusing the existing\n  lookup-or-create crearSupermercado(); manual entry is now \"Otro\".","tree":{"sha":"a36aee875608dc62234cc9b0dd8bd8c5e9842281","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/a36aee875608dc62234cc9b0dd8bd8c5e9842281"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/0c924ab089f1c5c059b718a68483bc508cd9fc89","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/0c924ab089f1c5c059b718a68483bc508cd9fc89","node_id":"C_kwDOT_HpC9oAKDBjOTI0YWIwODlmMWM1YzA1OWI3MThhNjg0ODNiYzUwOGNkOWZjODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/d3fcab96694ecf67df45bdbd7a0baf49e9301ee1","sha":"d3fcab96694ecf67df45bdbd7a0baf49e9301ee1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/d3fcab96694ecf67df45bdbd7a0baf49e9301ee1"}],"sha":"0c924ab089f1c5c059b718a68483bc508cd9fc89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/0c924ab089f1c5c059b718a68483bc508cd9fc89"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/d3fcab96694ecf67df45bdbd7a0baf49e9301ee1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T13:08:13Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T13:08:13Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Fix floating tab bar and FABs scrolling away on web\n\nTwo related bugs found from a real production screenshot (mobile\nSafari) after the redesign:\n\n1. The floating tab bar and FAB buttons used position:''absolute'',\n   which in RN Web positions relative to the scrollable content\n   container, not the browser viewport. With a long list they''d sit\n   at a fixed point within the content instead of floating fixed at\n   the screen edge. Fixed with position:''fixed'' on web (app-tabs.web.tsx\n   directly; Platform.select in the shared screens/*.tsx files, since\n   native''s ''absolute'' already worked correctly there).\n\n2. Found while investigating the same report: InventarioScreen lost\n   its real scroll container when the original SectionList was\n   replaced with a plain View/.map() during the redesign. The app''s\n   body has overflow:hidden by design (each screen scrolls internally,\n   not the page), so content taller than the viewport became\n   unreachable by normal scrolling - Safari''s elastic touch scroll\n   partially masked this, which is what actually produced the bug\n   screenshot. Fixed by wrapping both the mobile and desktop content\n   in a real ScrollView, matching every other screen in the app.\n\nVerified on both breakpoints with a seeded 26-item list: the header\nscrolls away with the content, the tab bar and FABs stay pinned.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ebf6f4dd1777fb91e904df245aeca15005820e3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/ebf6f4dd1777fb91e904df245aeca15005820e3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/d3fcab96694ecf67df45bdbd7a0baf49e9301ee1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/d3fcab96694ecf67df45bdbd7a0baf49e9301ee1","node_id":"C_kwDOT_HpC9oAKGQzZmNhYjk2Njk0ZWNmNjdkZjQ1YmRiZDdhMGJhZjQ5ZTkzMDFlZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/493dc72f24370d83d8eb1a4bec68ae976ab7c52e","sha":"493dc72f24370d83d8eb1a4bec68ae976ab7c52e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/493dc72f24370d83d8eb1a4bec68ae976ab7c52e"}],"sha":"d3fcab96694ecf67df45bdbd7a0baf49e9301ee1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/d3fcab96694ecf67df45bdbd7a0baf49e9301ee1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/493dc72f24370d83d8eb1a4bec68ae976ab7c52e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T02:09:11Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T02:09:11Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Apply the Alacena Calida redesign across the whole app\n\nNew design tokens (constants/colors.ts), Quicksand typography, Lucide\nicons, pill radii and new shadows, following the handoff found in\ndesign_handoff_alacena_calida/ (kept in the repo as reference, same\nas assets/brand-alacena/ before it). Touches every screen: AuthScreen,\nthe web tab bar (with a new mobile/desktop breakpoint split),\nInventarioScreen (including a new desktop grid layout with a\n\"para reponer\" rail reusing the existing fn_generar_lista_compra RPC\nand useDashboardAhorro hook), the add-product/detail modals, Modo\nSupermercado (dark progress card, live discount-savings preview via\nthe existing fn_calcular_precio_final RPC instead of reimplementing\nthe formula client-side), Historial/Dashboard (new bar-chart\ncomponent shared with the Inventario rail), and the ticket-scan modal\n(product matching now runs right after OCR instead of at save time,\nso the \"producto nuevo\" badge can show before confirming).\n\nThe native tab bar only gets a color update (best-effort, agreed with\nthe user) since NativeTabs can''t reproduce the web pill styling.\n\nVerified screen-by-screen against the actual design canvas (rendered\nand screenshotted via Playwright, not just the written spec) on Expo\nWeb against local Supabase, including a full functional pass (adding\na product, marking a discounted item as purchased, generating a\nshopping list from the desktop rail).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"262e3407467d3a658f9a9c947e1338877306f1b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/262e3407467d3a658f9a9c947e1338877306f1b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/493dc72f24370d83d8eb1a4bec68ae976ab7c52e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/493dc72f24370d83d8eb1a4bec68ae976ab7c52e","node_id":"C_kwDOT_HpC9oAKDQ5M2RjNzJmMjQzNzBkODNkOGViMWE0YmVjNjhhZTk3NmFiN2M1MmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/e893f56516bf30ea80250150059eb693ab590e2a","sha":"e893f56516bf30ea80250150059eb693ab590e2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/e893f56516bf30ea80250150059eb693ab590e2a"}],"sha":"493dc72f24370d83d8eb1a4bec68ae976ab7c52e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/493dc72f24370d83d8eb1a4bec68ae976ab7c52e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/e893f56516bf30ea80250150059eb693ab590e2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T00:13:42Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T00:13:42Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Drop the self-hosted runner, go fully manual for the SEPA sync\n\nSelf-hosted runners aren''t safe on a public repo — GitHub explicitly\nwarns that a fork can open a PR to run arbitrary code on that\nmachine. Removes sync-catalogo-sepa.yml entirely; the sync script\nstays for manual/local runs. sepa-reminder.yml now just emails a\nMonday 9am ART nudge to actually run it, instead of a pre-run \"turn\non the PC\" heads-up.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74d48fdecf8594117fa2666853e6980ac2b26551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/74d48fdecf8594117fa2666853e6980ac2b26551"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/e893f56516bf30ea80250150059eb693ab590e2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/e893f56516bf30ea80250150059eb693ab590e2a","node_id":"C_kwDOT_HpC9oAKGU4OTNmNTY1MTZiZjMwZWE4MDI1MDE1MDA1OWViNjkzYWI1OTBlMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/71bd999339123842f7a947e1981407cb3fbc0bc8","sha":"71bd999339123842f7a947e1981407cb3fbc0bc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/71bd999339123842f7a947e1981407cb3fbc0bc8"}],"sha":"e893f56516bf30ea80250150059eb693ab590e2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/e893f56516bf30ea80250150059eb693ab590e2a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/71bd999339123842f7a947e1981407cb3fbc0bc8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T00:05:59Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T00:05:59Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Move SEPA sync to a self-hosted runner, weekly with an email reminder\n\nGitHub-hosted runners are blocked by the site''s WAF (403, Azure IP\nrange) the same way Anthropic cloud routines are blocked by their own\nsandbox''s egress allowlist — both verified against production. Only a\nresidential IP works, so the sync now runs on a self-hosted runner\n(the user''s own machine), Mondays 11:00 ART only, with a separate\nhosted-runner workflow emailing a reminder 30 min ahead so the runner\nmachine is on in time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a614d335098063d93fbac518010e432899f425e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/8a614d335098063d93fbac518010e432899f425e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/71bd999339123842f7a947e1981407cb3fbc0bc8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/71bd999339123842f7a947e1981407cb3fbc0bc8","node_id":"C_kwDOT_HpC9oAKDcxYmQ5OTkzMzkxMjM4NDJmN2E5NDdlMTk4MTQwN2NiM2ZiYzBiYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/13dea2ab68f5f6d813c4299d0f5ceb961db5aef6","sha":"13dea2ab68f5f6d813c4299d0f5ceb961db5aef6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/13dea2ab68f