378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/67053c6e146965513d963c637bbed400a849c277/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T03:06:47Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T03:06:47Z","email":"gmenghi40@gmail.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Add shopping list total and 3x2/4x3/nxm discount types\n\n- fn_calcular_precio_final: extracts the discount formula out of the\n  purchase trigger into its own IMMUTABLE function, since it''s now\n  needed in two places.\n- detalle_lista.precio_estimado: generated column applying that same\n  formula before purchase (precio_final only fills in once an item is\n  checked off). ModoSupermercadoScreen sums precio_final/precio_estimado\n  to show \"Total estimado\" without recomputing the discount math in JS.\n- tipo_descuento gains ''nxm'' (\"buy N, pay N-1\"), generalizing 3x2 and\n  4x3 as presets plus letting a custom N cover any other promo, instead\n  of adding an enum value per combination. 2x1 stays as-is.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1cd1295b1a090db9318b0a714fe81aab8dd98849","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/1cd1295b1a090db9318b0a714fe81aab8dd98849"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/67053c6e146965513d963c637bbed400a849c277","verification"