Add exit/cancel/delete list and delete inventory item\n\nModo Supermercado gets a \"‹ Salir\" header button that offers\ncancelling the active list (keeps it as a historical record) or\ndeleting it outright (detalle_lista cascades via its existing FK).\nNeither touches inventario_hogar/precios_historico for items already\nbought — those are real purchases, not undone by exiting the list.\nDetalleProductoModal gets an \"Eliminar del inventario\" button with an\ninline confirm, removing only the user''s inventario_hogar row (never\nthe shared productos_base catalog entry).\n\nNo migration needed — RLS/GRANTs already allowed these deletes.\n\nFixes a bug surfaced while testing the exit flow: modo-supermercado.tsx\nnever reset its \"Crear lista manual\" form state after creating a list,\nso returning to the empty screen after cancelling/deleting showed the\nform still expanded instead of the button.\n\nVerified end-to-end against local Docker Supabase via Playwright,\nincluding confirming via direct DB query that cancel vs. delete behave\ncorrectly and don''t cross-contaminate between test runs.","tree":{"sha":"d4fefb2fcfef5cc8a5e86765e16b9e17f061282b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/d4fefb2fcfef5cc8a5e86765e16b9e17f061282b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/6c6cb143f84f60dbee06129346932ada59d58f0f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/6c6cb143f84f60dbee06129346932ada59d58f0f","node_id":"C_kwDOT_HpC9oAKDZjNmNiMTQzZjg0ZjYwZGJlZTA2MTI5MzQ2OTMyYWRhNTlkNThmMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/96dc09fcdffa8f5fbe11ce81fa8b0d08f1365d4a","sha":"96dc09fcdffa8f5fbe11ce81fa8b0d08f1365d4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/96dc09fcdffa8f5fbe11ce81fa8b0d08f1365d4a"}],"sha":"6c6cb143f84f60dbee06129346932ada59d58f0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/6c6cb143f84f60dbee06129346932ada59d58f0f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/96dc09fcdffa8f5fbe11ce81fa8b0d08f1365d4a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T16:46:41Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T16:46:41Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Add manual shopping lists with supermarket/price/discount entry\n\nUsers can now create a shopping list manually (choose a supermarket\nup front) or keep using the existing auto-generate-from-low-stock\nbutton — both converge on the same Modo Supermercado screen, where a\nnew \"+\" adds products with cantidad/precio/descuento/supermercado.\nMarking an item bought reuses the existing fn_comprar_item_lista\ntrigger unchanged; no migration needed since RLS/GRANTs on\nlistas_compra/detalle_lista/supermercados already fully supported\nthese client-side inserts.\n\n- hooks/useSupermercados.ts + screens/SupermercadoPicker.tsx: same\n  chip-picker pattern as categorias, without Realtime (single-instance\n  use) or edit (no rename requirement).\n- screens/DescuentoPicker.tsx: shared chip row over the 5\n  tipo_descuento values, reused by the add-item modal and the inline\n  per-row discount editor.\n- screens/AgregarItemListaModal.tsx: same search-or-create-product\n  flow as AgregarProductoModal, inserting into detalle_lista instead\n  of inventario_hogar.\n- Fixes a real bug in ModoSupermercadoScreen''s marcarComprado: it\n  unconditionally sent precio_unitario from an always-empty local\n  edit field, silently wiping out price/discount already set when a\n  manually-added item was checked off without editing it. Now falls\n  back to the item''s existing values.\n- InventarioScreen: category sections are now collapsible (tap the\n  header, chevron + item count), plus a light density pass on\n  Inventario/Modo Supermercado cards.\n- EscanearTicketModal''s inline supermarket lookup-or-create is now\n  handled by the shared hook instead of duplicated logic.\n\nVerified end-to-end against local Docker Supabase via Playwright,\nincluding checking the actual computed precio_final in the database\nfor both a preloaded and an inline-edited discount.","tree":{"sha":"44b7394f0924dce3dcc99ca0bd1ad683931a2839","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/44b7394f0924dce3dcc99ca0bd1ad683931a2839"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/96dc09fcdffa8f5fbe11ce81fa8b0d08f1365d4a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/96dc09fcdffa8f5fbe11ce81fa8b0d08f1365d4a","node_id":"C_kwDOT_HpC9oAKDk2ZGMwOWZjZGZmYThmNWZiZTExY2U4MWZhOGIwZDA4ZjEzNjVkNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/2247f5cb68702cb64b874f02bb7b498da3c69b2a","sha":"2247f5cb68702cb64b874f02bb7b498da3c69b2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/2247f5cb68702cb64b874f02bb7b498da3c69b2a"}],"sha":"96dc09fcdffa8f5fbe11ce81fa8b0d08f1365d4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/96dc09fcdffa8f5fbe11ce81fa8b0d08f1365d4a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/2247f5cb68702cb64b874f02bb7b498da3c69b2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:59:48Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:59:48Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Merge feature/fase6-categorias-frontend: category management + product detail\n\nRealtime replication fix, dynamic category picker with inline\ncreate/edit, and a product detail modal for editing categoría/stock\nmínimo/vencimiento (Fase 6).","tree":{"sha":"21804ed80d791eb58317dc6fb4ab7f966f91e1f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/21804ed80d791eb58317dc6fb4ab7f966f91e1f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/2247f5cb68702cb64b874f02bb7b498da3c69b2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/2247f5cb68702cb64b874f02bb7b498da3c69b2a","node_id":"C_kwDOT_HpC9oAKDIyNDdmNWNiNjg3MDJjYjY0Yjg3NGYwMmJiN2I0OThkYTNjNjliMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/ece0bf75ab194b7c4f8094d3e7507f873233ad37","sha":"ece0bf75ab194b7c4f8094d3e7507f873233ad37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/ece0bf75ab194b7c4f8094d3e7507f873233ad37"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/3697b1a2ee37c89db6e18ee148af5307a82b34c9","sha":"3697b1a2ee37c89db6e18ee148af5307a82b34c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/3697b1a2ee37c89db6e18ee148af5307a82b34c9"}],"sha":"2247f5cb68702cb64b874f02bb7b498da3c69b2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/2247f5cb68702cb64b874f02bb7b498da3c69b2a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/3697b1a2ee37c89db6e18ee148af5307a82b34c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:52:10Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:52:10Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Add category management and product detail/edit view\n\nUsers can now tap a product in Inventario to see its detail and edit\ncategory/stock mínimo/fecha de vencimiento, and create or rename\ncategories inline (with an icon) from the same picker used when\nadding a product — no more fixed 3-category enum.\n\n- hooks/useCategorias.ts: fetch + Realtime + create/edit, with an\n  optimistic local push and self-healing duplicate-name handling.\n- screens/CategoriaPicker.tsx: shared chip selector with inline\n  create/edit, reused by AgregarProductoModal and the new\n  DetalleProductoModal.\n- screens/DetalleProductoModal.tsx: two separate save actions\n  (category vs. stock/vencimiento) since they live in different\n  tables with different ownership (shared catalog vs. per-user row).\n- InventarioScreen now drives its SectionList sections from the\n  categorias table instead of a hardcoded 3-item array, and cards are\n  tappable to open the detail modal.\n- Also fixes a pre-existing bug where the floating web tab bar\n  intercepted clicks on the topmost list item (centralized the fix in\n  app-tabs.web.tsx instead of patching per-screen).\n\nTested end-to-end against local Docker Supabase via Playwright:\ncategory creation/rename, cross-instance Realtime sync, product\ncategory change, and stock/vencimiento edits.","tree":{"sha":"21804ed80d791eb58317dc6fb4ab7f966f91e1f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/21804ed80d791eb58317dc6fb4ab7f966f91e1f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/3697b1a2ee37c89db6e18ee148af5307a82b34c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login"