epo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/a81b9bc3a1212ddde07cb9239bfd6293dff3d591/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:48:29Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:48:29Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Enable Realtime replication for categorias and inventario_hogar\n\nFound while testing the new categories picker locally: no table was\nin the supabase_realtime publication, neither locally nor in\nproduction (confirmed with pg_publication_tables). useInventario''s\nRealtime subscription had silently never worked — masked by its\noptimistic local updates making the UI feel responsive regardless.\ncategorias needs this for cross-instance sync (the picker mounts\nindependently inside AgregarProductoModal and DetalleProductoModal);\ninventario_hogar is the same bug, fixed alongside since it''s a\none-line addition to the same migration.","tree":{"sha":"72ad7d649d87c2924e0735a73cd0cd5e47e2c9ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/72ad7d649d87c2924e0735a73cd0cd5e47e2c9ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/a81b9bc3a1212ddde07cb9239bfd6293dff3d591","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar