iptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/df6d6390a2353075ffa305cb4e0332b089078093/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T14:58:11Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T14:58:11Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Merge feature/fase6-categorias-dinamicas: categorias dinámicas\n\nReemplaza el enum fijo de categoria por una tabla editable, base\npara poder agregar/editar categorías desde la app (Fase 6).","tree":{"sha":"94c952a8de4a34d2243e946eb1dd44b3cbe4be28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/94c952a8de4a34d2243e946eb1dd44b3cbe4be28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/df6d6390a2353075ffa305cb4e0332b089078093","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/df6d6390a2353075ffa305cb4e0332b089078093","node_id":"C_kwDOT_HpC9oAKGRmNmQ2MzkwYTIzNTMwNzVmZmEzMDVjYjRlMDMzMmIwODkwNzgwOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/e60c95fcd28fef1e66f1e0f2ece0cb86e9fdaf6d","sha":"e60c95fcd28fef1e66f1e0f2ece0cb86e9fdaf6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/e60c95fcd28fef1e66f1e0f2ece0cb86e9fdaf6d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/497a381dabe5d79fbe791ac1026865730c330e8c","sha":"497a381dabe5d79fbe791ac1026865730c330e8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/497a381dabe5d79fbe791ac1026865730c330e8c"}],"sha":"df6d6390a2353075ffa305cb4e0332b089078093","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/df6d6390a2353075ffa305cb4e0332b089078093"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/497a381dabe5d79fbe791ac1026865730c330e8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T14:55:53Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T14:55:53Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Replace categoria enum with editable categorias table\n\nCategories were a fixed Postgres enum, so users could never add or\nrename them from the app. Swap productos_base.categoria and\ncatalogo_sepa_ref.categoria_sugerida to FKs into a new categorias\ntable (nombre + icono), add the missing UPDATE policy on\nproductos_base needed to change a product''s category, and rewrite\nbuscar_producto_similar to return category name/icon instead of the\nenum value. Fase 6.\n\nTested against local Docker Supabase: backfill from pre-existing enum\ndata, RLS UPDATE as the authenticated role (not just service_role),\nand the LEFT JOIN null-category case for SEPA suggestions.","tree":{"sha":"94c952a8de4a34d2243e946eb1dd44b3cbe4be28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/94c952a8de4a34d2243e946eb1dd44b3cbe4be28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/497a381dabe5d79fbe791ac1026865730c330e8c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https: