,"organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/50ab9134167feb2cd3763bc8c81b00f74482bc02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T22:57:11Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T22:57:11Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Merge feature/fase4-ocr-tickets: OCR de tickets via Claude vision\n\nAdds a stateless Edge Function (procesar-ticket) that extracts\nstructured items from a ticket photo or PDF via Claude, and a review\nscreen (EscanearTicketModal) where the user confirms before matching\nproducts and writing to precios_historico. Already deployed to the\nlinked project via `supabase functions deploy` and validated with a\nreal user-provided ticket, in addition to the base64-prefix bug found\nand fixed along the way (see commit 3f17d3d for details).","tree":{"sha":"d5ba88dfea5961679fdba38955701142632f660d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/d5ba88dfea5961679fdba38955701142632f660d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/50ab9134167feb2cd3763bc8c81b00f74482bc02","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/50ab9134167feb2cd3763bc8c81b00f74482bc02","node_id":"C_kwDOT_HpC9oAKDUwYWI5MTM0MTY3ZmViMmNkMzc2M2JjOGM4MWIwMGY3NDQ4MmJjMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/8ffd5baf68e97cf848d7aca7b7861677f8e3b4e8","sha":"8ffd5baf68e97cf848d7aca7b7861677f8e3b4e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/8ffd5baf68e97cf848d7aca7b7861677f8e3b4e8"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/3f17d3dcf331a30719d40905609af735489d13ad","sha":"3f17d3dcf331a30719d40905609af735489d13ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/3f17d3dcf331a30719d40905609af735489d13ad"}],"sha":"50ab9134167feb2cd3763bc8c81b00f74482bc02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/50ab9134167feb2cd3763bc8c81b00f74482bc02"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/3f17d3dcf331a30719d40905609af735489d13ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T22:56:35Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T22:56:35Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Add Fase 4: OCR de tickets via Claude vision\n\nsupabase/functions/procesar-ticket/index.ts is a stateless Edge\nFunction: takes a base64 photo or PDF, calls Claude (claude-opus-5,\noutput_config.format json_schema) for structured item extraction, and\nreturns it — no DB writes. EscanearTicketModal.tsx lets the user\nreview/edit the extracted items before matching them\n(buscar_producto_similar) and inserting into precios_historico\n(fuente = ''ocr_ticket''), same as the manual flow already does.\n\nAuth: the function checks supabase.auth.getUser() with the caller''s\ntoken and 401s on no real user, on top of the platform''s own JWT\ngate — it bills per call, so it can''t be left open to anyone holding\nthe public anon key.\n\nPhoto and PDF are different Messages API content blocks (image vs\ndocument), not just a different media_type — the function branches on\nthat.\n\nReal bug found via a live test (not visible from reading the code):\non web, expo-document-picker returns the *full* data URI\n(\"data:application/pdf;base64,XXXX\") in its base64 field, unlike\nexpo-image-picker which already strips the prefix. Sending the\nunstripped string to Claude 400''s with \"Invalid base64 data\". Fixed\nby stripping the prefix in EscanearTicketModal.tsx. Verified the fix\nby intercepting the outgoing request payload — clean base64, correct\ncharset — before confirming with a real paid Claude call.\n\nAlso added expo-document-picker + expo-file-system (PDF picking and\nthe native base64 fallback, since DocumentPickerAsset.base64 only\nexists on web) and expo-image-picker (photo capture/library), plus\nits required app.json config plugin entry for camera/photo\npermissions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d5ba88dfea5961679fdba38955701142632f660d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/d5ba88dfea5961679fdba38955701142632f660d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/3f17d3dcf331a30719d40905609af735489d13ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/3f17d3dcf331a30719d40905609af735489d13ad","node_id":"C_kwDOT_HpC9oAKDNmMTdkM2RjZjMzMWEzMDcxOWQ0MDkwNTYwOWFmNzM1NDg5ZDEzYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commit/8ffd5baf68e97cf848d7aca7b7861677f8e3b4e8","sha":"8ffd5baf68e97cf848d7aca7b7861677f8e3b4e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/8ffd5baf68e97cf848d7aca7b7861677f8e3b4e8"}],"sha":"3f17d3dcf331a30719d40905609af735489d13ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/3f17d3dcf331a30719d40905609af735489d13ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/8ffd5baf68e97cf848d7aca7b7861677f8e3b4e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:38:42Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:38:42Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Regenerate real types after deploying Fase 5\n\nConfirmed all 3 views are live on the linked project. The generated\nRow types mark every view column nullable (Postgres doesn''t expose\nNOT NULL through views to the introspection query gen types uses),\neven though these are never actually null in practice — aggregates\nover NOT NULL columns, inner joins. Redefined GastoMensual /\nMejorSupermercadoProducto / TendenciaPrecio as non-null versions, same\npattern InventarioItem already uses for estado_stock, and cast at the\nfetch boundary in useDashboardAhorro.ts instead of scattering null\nchecks through the screen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"de3613f0f436e1ea04452d1b3019132284cbbe95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/de3613f0f436e1ea04452d1b3019132284cbbe95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/8ffd5baf68e97cf848d7aca7b7861677f8e3b4e8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"htt