:96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/a21d8ddfbe20d53139a42e373d2a4ed6ea3b28bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T20:23:20Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T20:23:20Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Add manual creation of an active shopping list\n\nmodo-supermercado.tsx now offers a \"Crear lista de compras\" button\nwhen there''s no active lista_compra, instead of a dead end. It builds\nthe list from whatever''s currently red/yellow in inventario_hogar,\nrequesting enough of each to get back to stock_minimo (at least 1\nunit) — the same criterion Fase 3''s auto-generation will use later,\njust triggered by hand for now instead of on a schedule.\n\nValidated end-to-end against a local Supabase stack: seeded a red and\na yellow item for a real signed-up user, created the list, confirmed\nboth the item set and the computed quantities were correct in the\nresulting checklist, no console errors.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a8ffe84fe4fe8ebffb8ef5d6e09d1f7302c6809a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/a8ffe84fe4fe8ebffb8ef5d6e09d1f7302c6809a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/a21d8ddfbe20d53139a42e373d2a4ed6ea3b28bb","verif