nzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/46140154764b94c61b8cfd4ffc0c7974099bf91f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T16:44:50Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T16:44:50Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Wire fuzzy-search autocomplete into the add-product flow\n\nhooks/useBuscarProductoSimilar.ts wraps buscar_producto_similar()\n(debounced 300ms). AgregarProductoModal.tsx now branches on match\norigin: ''propio'' (existing productos_base row, has a real id) goes\nstraight to the cantidad step; ''sepa'' (catalog suggestion, id is\nnull) prefills the crear-nuevo form instead, since it still has to be\ninserted into productos_base first.\n\nNeeded a follow-up migration (20260822163201) because the original\nbuscar_producto_similar() didn''t return productos_base.id at all —\nwithout it the frontend had no way to know which product to add to\ninventario_hogar for a ''propio'' match short of re-searching by name.\nAlso found GRANT SELECT was missing on catalogo_sepa_ref for\nanon/authenticated (20260822164109) — RLS policies don''t help without\nthe table-level grant first, so every real query 403''d.\n\nValidated end-to-end against a local Supabase stack pointed at by a\ntemporary .env swap (restored after): real signup, searched a seeded\n''propio'' product and a seeded ''sepa'' suggestion, both completed the\nfull add-to-inventory flow with no console errors.\n\ntypes/database.types.ts: hand-added the Functions entry for\nbuscar_producto_similar since it doesn''t exist on the remote project\nyet (this branch isn''t deployed) — replace with a real `gen types` run\nafter merging.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae408dcc491ed102f8ea964e1efee3055c34a77c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/ae408dcc491ed102f8ea964e1efee3055c34a77c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/46140154764b94c61b8cfd4ffc0c7974099bf91f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonz