":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Add fuzzy product matching (pg_trgm/unaccent) + SEPA catalog stub\n\nAdditive-only migration: catalogo_sepa_ref (reference dictionary\nsynced from the SEPA/Precios Claros dataset, RLS public-read) and\nbuscar_producto_similar(), which matches free-text input against the\nuser''s own productos_base first, falling back to the SEPA catalog.\n\nValidated end-to-end against a local shadow DB (supabase start +\ndb lint), not just applied blind:\n- unaccent() is STABLE, not IMMUTABLE — can''t be used directly in a\n  functional index; wrapped in inmutable_unaccent().\n- A file-level `SET search_path` doesn''t reliably carry across\n  statements in the CLI''s migration runner, so every reference is\n  explicitly schema-qualified (public.*, OPERATOR(public.%)) instead\n  of relying on it.\n- The original UNION ALL had no column aliases, so `ORDER BY\n  similitud` couldn''t resolve — added explicit aliases.\n\nsupabase/functions/sync-catalogo-sepa/index.ts is a documented 501\nstub for the periodic SEPA sync job (not implemented). tsconfig.json\nnow excludes supabase/functions/ since it''s a separate Deno runtime,\nnot part of the Expo/RN TypeScript project.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"28a7980ca749d248ff78a3d0d51856d336b94814","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/28a7980ca749d248ff78a3d0d51856d336b94814"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/d7a4b5bfe9fa003d688884f42f958a1eafd3f1f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/oth