scriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/commits/e98f7c451898ab6db49ed5526f253b1a0e1ecba5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T14:30:42Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T14:30:42Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Fix blank Inventario screen on empty inventory\n\nSectionList''s ListEmptyComponent wasn''t rendering with a real\nauthenticated session + real (empty) data on web, even though the\nexact same empty-state path worked in isolated testing (fake session,\nunauthenticated real fetch). Sibling screens using plain View/Text\n(Supermercado, Historial) were unaffected, isolating this to\nSectionList itself rather than the auth/data layer. Side-stepping it\nby handling the empty case before SectionList ever mounts, matching\nthe pattern already proven to work elsewhere in the app.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d78408b6979e2cbe02cabe2dc2c4a2e4359ef09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/4d78408b6979e2cbe02cabe2dc2c4a2e4359ef09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/e98f7c451898ab6db49ed5526f253b1a0e1ecba5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_