-21T01:46:14Z","email":"gonzalo.menghi@prophero.com","name":"Gonzalo Menghi"},"message":"Wire bottom tab navigation to real inventory screens\n\nConnects InventarioScreen and ModoSupermercadoScreen (previously\nunreachable) to actual routes, adds a Historial placeholder, and\nremoves the leftover create-expo-app scaffold (Home/Explore tabs and\ntheir unused components).\n\nAlso switches web.output from \"static\" to \"single\": SSR was crashing\non import of lib/supabase.ts (AsyncStorage assumes `window`, Realtime\nneeds native WebSocket) now that a real screen finally renders it.\nThis app has no SEO need, so a client-only SPA is the right output.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1932bea208bae17f7f630dfa6bfa8ca324b3121b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/trees/1932bea208bae17f7f630dfa6bfa8ca324b3121b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gonzalomenghi/inventario-hogar/git/commits/77b4d5934ca17d73d15918da540096e0035a5821","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96753378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gonzalomenghi","id":96753378,"login":"gonzalomenghi","node_id":"U_kgDOBcRW4g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gonzalomenghi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/go