ni"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:18:26.396Z","repositoryId":1341472365,"sha":"37fe45592a2479204b6b4afff2193c86d8429e0b"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"ImmanuelHirani","providerType":"User"},"email":"immanuel.chirani@gmail.com","name":"immanuel christian hirani"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-21T06:29:00Z","committedDate":"2026-08-21T06:29:00Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"ImmanuelHirani","providerType":"User"},"email":"immanuel.chirani@gmail.com","name":"immanuel christian hirani"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:18:26.396Z","repositoryId":1341472365,"sha":"594d251ebdfad6da96f3795dd2519761db39f845"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"ImmanuelHirani","providerType":"User"},"email":"immanuel.chirani@gmail.com","name":"immanuel christian hirani"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-21T06:23:55Z","committedDate":"2026-08-21T06:23:55Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"ImmanuelHirani","providerType":"User"},"email":"immanuel.chirani@gmail.com","name":"immanuel christian hirani"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:18:26.396Z","repositoryId":1341472365,"sha":"2880757d46f945dac51269688517b14efe910595"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:18:26.396Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134191515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImmanuelHirani","id":134191515,"login":"ImmanuelHirani","node_id":"U_kgDOB_-Zmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/commits/dab3080d64e1240c85a7da391f696437cf5d41f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T09:38:38Z","email":"immanuel.chirani@gmail.com","name":"immanuel christian hirani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T09:38:38Z","email":"immanuel.chirani@gmail.com","name":"immanuel christian hirani"},"message":"Let the KTP scanner read an existing image, not only the camera\n\nAdds a file route alongside live capture. Both draw to the same canvas, so\nrecognition, parsing and confirmation keep one implementation.\n\nThis is not only a convenience. Camera failure -- permission denied, no\ndevice, insecure context -- previously left the feature with no way\nforward at all; every one of those messages now points at choosing a file\ninstead, and the button stays available in every stage except while the\nrecogniser is running.\n\nChosen images are scaled to a 2200px longest edge before OCR: a phone\nphoto is routinely 4000px wide and Tesseract''s cost scales with pixel\ncount, while KTP text stays legible well below that. Never scaled up --\nenlarging a blurry capture adds work, not detail. Non-images are rejected\nwith a readable message, formats that cannot decode (HEIC, PDF) are caught\nexplicitly rather than yielding a blank canvas, and the object URL is\nalways revoked so a chosen file is not pinned in memory.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5a7bc015686569b09f02e91510318019f9b41f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/git/trees/e5a7bc015686569b09f02e91510318019f9b41f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/git/commits/dab3080d64e1240c85a7da391f696437cf5d41f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134191515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImmanuelHirani","id":134191515,"login":"ImmanuelHirani","node_id":"U_kgDOB_-Zmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/commit/dab3080d64e1240c85a7da391f696437cf5d41f3","node_id":"C_kwDOT_U-bdoAKGRhYjMwODBkNjRlMTI0MGM4NWE3ZGEzOTFmNjk2NDM3Y2Y1ZDQxZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/commit/b119fdf3e8bfa10eec00d051379744de72512695","sha":"b119fdf3e8bfa10eec00d051379744de72512695","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/commits/b119fdf3e8bfa10eec00d051379744de72512695"}],"sha":"dab3080d64e1240c85a7da391f696437cf5d41f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/commits/dab3080d64e1240c85a7da391f696437cf5d41f3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134191515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImmanuelHirani","id":134191515,"login":"ImmanuelHirani","node_id":"U_kgDOB_-Zmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/commits/b119fdf3e8bfa10eec00d051379744de72512695/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T09:29:24Z","email":"immanuel.chirani@gmail.com","name":"immanuel christian hirani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T09:29:24Z","email":"immanuel.chirani@gmail.com","name":"immanuel christian hirani"},"message":"Make module recovery honest, and surface newly created rows\n\nRemoteBoundary: the \"Try again\" button could never work. Two caches sit\nbetween the boundary and the remote -- React.lazy memoises its rejected\npromise, and the browser''s module map caches the failed import against the\nscript URL for the life of the page. Clearing Module Federation''s own\nmoduleCache does not reach the second one, and neither does rewriting the\nremote''s entry URL with a cache-buster; both were tried against a remote\nthat had already restarted and was answering 200. The button now reloads\nand says why, which is the only recovery that actually works.\n\nUsersPage: after a create, switch to created_at desc and drop the cursor.\nThe table was already refreshing correctly, but the default ordering is by\nrandom uuid, so a new record landed in an arbitrary position -- usually\npages away. The toast said it worked while the table showed no sign of it,\nwhich reads as a broken refresh rather than as ordering.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87fa57f7da5c5790d59ca7abe72199d78208a8da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/git/trees/87fa57f7da5c5790d59ca7abe72199d78208a8da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/git/commits/b119fdf3e8bfa10eec00d051379744de72512695","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134191515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImmanuelHirani","id":134191515,"login":"ImmanuelHirani","node_id":"U_kgDOB_-Zmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/commit/b119fdf3e8bfa10eec00d051379744de72512695","node_id":"C_kwDOT_U-bdoAKGIxMTlmZGYzZThiZmExMGVlYzAwZDA1MTM3OTc0NGRlNzI1MTI2OTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/commit/08d51610c2e1f1a01a0863b0bf1e5dc410d4f8f7","sha":"08d51610c2e1f1a01a0863b0bf1e5dc410d4f8f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/commits/08d51610c2e1f1a01a0863b0bf1e5dc410d4f8f7"}],"sha":"b119fdf3e8bfa10eec00d051379744de72512695","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/commits/b119fdf3e8bfa10eec00d051379744de72512695"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134191515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImmanuelHirani","id":134191515,"login":"ImmanuelHirani","node_id":"U_kgDOB_-Zmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/commits/08d51610c2e1f1a01a0863b0bf1e5dc410d4f8f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T09:15:00Z","email":"immanuel.chirani@gmail.com","name":"immanuel christian hirani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T09:15:00Z","email":"immanuel.chirani@gmail.com","name":"immanuel christian hirani"},"message":"Add app-wide toasts, KTP camera scan, and fix sort UX\n\nToasts: a shared queue in the React Query cache (a federation singleton,\nunlike @jasindo/shared) so the auth remote, users remote and host shell can\nall feed one renderer. ToastHost sits outside <Routes> because signing in\nand out both navigate, and a route-scoped renderer would unmount with the\nmessage still on it. Covers login, logout, create, update and delete;\nuseLogout no longer sweeps the queue it was about to display.\n\nKTP scan: camera capture plus Tesseract.js OCR, entirely client-side -- a\nphoto of a national ID is never uploaded. Parsing lives in lib/ktp.ts,\nseparate from the camera so it is testable without one, and handles the\ndigit/letter confusions OCR actually produces on card text. Results are\nalways shown for confirmation; nothing is auto-applied.\n\nSorting: replaced TanStack''s three-state cycle with a plain asc/desc\ntoggle. The third click cleared the sort, which reads as a bug -- the\narrow vanishes and rows jump to an order nobody asked for.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9f9edae0a2ba3d9ec6a52c693dde97197043632","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/git/trees/b9f9edae0a2ba3d9ec6a52c693dde97197043632"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/git/commits/08d51610c2e1f1a01a0863b0bf1e5dc410d4f8f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134191515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImmanuelHirani","id":134191515,"login":"ImmanuelHirani","node_id":"U_kgDOB_-Zmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/u