:"immanuel.chirani@gmail.com","name":"immanuel christian hirani"},"message":"docs: add a full microfrontend section to the demo companion\n\nExplains the host/remote model, maps every folder and the seven files\nthat implement it, walks the runtime sequence, and states the\nover-engineering trade-off plainly rather than defending it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2faad93fed23f72a88d181793824356787acc52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/git/trees/a2faad93fed23f72a88d181793824356787acc52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/git/commits/37fe45592a2479204b6b4afff2193c86d8429e0b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/134191515?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ImmanuelHirani","id":134191515,"login":"ImmanuelHirani","node_id":"U_kgDOB_-Zmw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ImmanuelHirani","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ImmanuelHirani/TestCase/commit/37fe45592a2479204b6b4afff2193c86d8429e0b","node_id":"C_kwDOT_U-bdoAKDM3ZmU0NTU5MmEyNDc5MjA0YjZiNGFmZmYyMTkzYzg2ZDg0MjllMGI","parents":[{"html_