,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:00:00Z","email":"99557970+berfinyuksel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"berfinyuksel"},"message":"Merge branch ''2026.3'' into ''2026.x''\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"baf114bde3d113f35246ba05a43c99cd893e77f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/pimcore-wysiwyg-editor/git/trees/baf114bde3d113f35246ba05a43c99cd893e77f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/pimcore-wysiwyg-editor/git/commits/abe70ceccfdc23c10677f6ea48749c81741d9588","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99557970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/berfinyuksel","id":99557970,"login":"berfinyuksel","node_id":"U_kgDOBe8iUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/pimcore-wysiwyg-editor/commit/abe70ceccfdc23c10677f6ea48749c81741d9588","node_id":"C_kwDOT_fY69oAKGFiZTcwY2VjY2ZkYzIzYzEwNjc3ZjZlYTQ4NzQ5YzgxNzQxZDk1ODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/pimcore-wysiwyg-editor/commit/5880d564304088b033914f0eb364634bf768c4f9","sha":"5880d564304088b033914f0eb364634bf768c4f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/pimcore-wysiwyg-editor/commits/5880d564304088b033914f0eb364634bf768c4f9"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/pimcore/pimcore-wysiwyg-editor/commit/34e750fdd64227ecbe68b7ee3cca16bc5c0419f2","sha":"34e750fdd64227ecbe68b7ee3cca16bc5c0419f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/pimcore-wysiwyg-editor/commits/34e750fdd64227ecbe68b7ee3cca16bc5c0419f2"}],"sha":"abe70ceccfdc23c10677f6ea48749c81741d9588","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/pimcore-wysiwyg-editor/commits/abe70ceccfdc23c10677f6ea48749c81741d9588"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99557970?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/berfinyuksel","id":99557970,"login":"berfinyuksel","node_id":"U_kgDOBe8iUg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/pimcore-wysiwyg-editor/commits/34e750fdd64227ecbe68b7ee3cca16bc5c0419f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:59:51Z","email":"99557970+berfinyuksel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"berfinyuksel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:59:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Pass SYNC_TOKEN to the studio frontend build (#34)\n\nPart of pimcore/DevOps-Tasks#65. The studio frontend build pushes its automatic commits as pimcore-deployments and only on pushes to version branches; PR runs upload the build as an artifact instead (pimcore/workflows-collection-public#168). The push run no longer cancels an in-progress run; the head-commit check in the reusable prevents a commit loop.\n\nUntil #168 is merged the \"Studio Frontend Build\" check fails at startup with \"secret SYNC_TOKEN is not defined in the referenced workflow\". That is expected; the check gets re-run after the merge, before this PR is marked ready.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"baf114bde3d113f35246ba05a43c99cd893e77f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/pimcore-wysiwyg-editor/git/trees/baf114bde3d113f35246ba05a43c99cd893e77f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/pimcore-wysiwyg-editor/git/commits/34e750fdd64227ecbe68b7ee3cca16bc5c0419f2","verification":{"payload":"tree baf114bde3d113f35246ba05a43c99cd893e77f4\nparent 5880d564304088b033914f0eb364634bf768c4f9\nauthor berfinyuksel <99557970+berfinyuksel@users.noreply.github.com> 1791395991 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791395991 +0200\n\nPass SYNC_TOKEN to the studio frontend build (#34)\n\nPart of pimcore/DevOps-Tasks#65. The studio frontend build pushes its automatic commits as pimcore-deployments and only on pushes to version branches; PR runs upload the build as an artifact instead (pimcore/workflows-collection-public#168). The push run no longer cancels an in-progress run; the head-commit check in the reusable prevents a commit loop.\n\nUntil #168 is merged the \"Studio Frontend Build\" check fails at startup with \"secret SYNC_TOKEN is not defined in the referenced workflow\". That is expected; the check gets re-run after the merge, before this PR is marked ready.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxoiXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA