s/jmars/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commits/396d7b1b0476fe2dd2fae1debb77b8a1f54ef57c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T15:38:07Z","email":"github@jaye.ch","name":"Jaye Marshall"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T15:38:07Z","email":"github@jaye.ch","name":"Jaye Marshall"},"message":"feat(router): basePath-aware URL construction for navigate/replace/data-mfe-route\n\nWhen an app runs at a subpath (basePath != ''/''), route paths are defined\nrelative to the base. Programmatic navigate/replace and data-mfe-route clicks\nnow re-prefix the basePath when building the pushed URL, so the address bar\nstays under the subpath (e.g. route ''/fixpoint-linux'' under basePath ''/dhake''\n-> ''/dhake/fixpoint-linux''). Idempotent for already-prefixed paths. Adds three\nbasePath router unit tests.","tree":{"sha":"3cb14c38d76c906846795339451e7de4bb0b792a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/git/trees/3cb14c38d76c906846795339451e7de4bb0b792a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/git/commits/396d7b1b0476fe2dd2fae1debb77b8a1f54ef57c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/615608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jmars","id