p MFEs to demo cross-MFE communication\n- Add comprehensive tests for bus.ts (13 tests) and store.ts (17 tests)\n- All 71+ existing tests + 30 new tests pass, typecheck and build clean\n\nREVIEW NEEDED = review","tree":{"sha":"5080187693e2019df254ccebed6acc9939c11e56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/git/trees/5080187693e2019df254ccebed6acc9939c11e56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/git/commits/4d4e8f97ab18485503974076d7381dc7501a7e3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commit/4d4e8f97ab18485503974076d7381dc7501a7e3d","node_id":"C_kwDOT_kRC9oAKDRkNGU4Zjk3YWIxODQ4NTUwMzk3NDA3NmQ3MzgxZGM3NTAxYTdlM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commit/7fd571e917d06df87f2b253f5c9eb91d15e95044","sha":"7fd571e917d06df87f2b253f5c9eb91d15e95044","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commits/7fd571e917d06df87f2b253f5c9eb91d15e95044"}],"sha":"4d4e8f97ab18485503974076d7381dc7501a7e3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commits/4d4e8f97ab18485503974076d7381dc7501a7e3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/615608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jmars","id":615608,"login":"jmars","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNTYwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commits/7fd571e917d06df87f2b253f5c9eb91d15e95044/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T02:48:15Z","email":"github@jaye.ch","name":"Jaye Marshall"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T02:48:15Z","email":"github@jaye.ch","name":"Jaye Marshall"},"message":"P2: @mfe/framework (router/template-loader/app shell) + native import-map demo. Fix DOM-agnostic router (tagName), .default module normalization, baseURL join, await initial render (double-render race); happy-dom URL/MouseEvent test env.","tree":{"sha":"7165c5348e95811f55993717e718ed951267a8d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/git/trees/7165c5348e95811f55993717e718ed951267a8d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/git/commits/7fd571e917d06df87f2b253f5c9eb91d15e95044","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/615608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jmars","id":615608,"login":"jmars","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNTYwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commit/7fd571e917d06df87f2b253f5c9eb91d15e95044","node_id":"C_kwDOT_kRC9oAKDdmZDU3MWU5MTdkMDZkZjg3ZjJiMjUzZjVjOWViOTFkMTVlOTUwNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commit/97486345c6396fe8132cc9e655d2a639d837641e","sha":"97486345c6396fe8132cc9e655d2a639d837641e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commits/97486345c6396fe8132cc9e655d2a639d837641e"}],"sha":"7fd571e917d06df87f2b253f5c9eb91d15e95044","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commits/7fd571e917d06df87f2b253f5c9eb91d15e95044"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commits/97486345c6396fe8132cc9e655d2a639d837641e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T02:40:27Z","email":"user@babylon.lan","name":"rattan sandbox user"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T02:40:57Z","email":"user@babylon.lan","name":"rattan sandbox user"},"message":"P2: Implement @mfe/framework with native router, template-loader, and app shell\n\n- router.ts: Native browser router replacing ''page'' npm dep\n  - createRouter({ routes, onNavigate, interceptClicks })\n  - Path matching with exact paths + :param segments\n  - Click delegation on document (same-origin <a>, no target=_blank, no modifier keys)\n  - history.pushState for navigation, popstate handling\n  - Custom ''app:route'' event dispatch\n  - navigate(), replace(), destroy() methods\n\n- template-loader.ts: Template loader with in-memory cache\n  - createTemplateLoader({ baseURL, fetchImpl })\n  - load(name) with caching, preload(), clearCache()\n  - Reuses @mfe/core''s loadTemplate for parsing\n\n- app.ts: App shell wiring router→loader→reconcile\n  - createApp({ root, routes, importModule, loadTemplate, host, baseURL, ssr })\n  - Config-driven routes (array or URL)\n  - SSR rehydration support (checks for ''ssr'' attribute on root)\n  - Dynamic import via browser import map\n\n- index.ts: Barrel export of framework API\n\n- Tests: router.test.js, template-loader.test.js, app.test.js\n  - Path matching including :param segments\n  - Cache behavior\n  - App mounting and navigation\n\n- Demo: Native import map in index.html, placeholder vanilla MFEs\n  - /mf/header.js, /mf/homepage.js, /mf/about.js, /mf/user.js\n  - main.ts bootstraps createApp with inlined templates\n\nNO React, NO bundler, NO ''page'' dep. Browser-native ESM via import map.","tree":{"sha":"92e70e60f6bc395260f1cd55c0665bef8dca3557","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/git/trees/92e70e60f6bc395260f1cd55c0665bef8dca3557"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/git/commits/97486345c6396fe8132cc9e655d2a639d837641e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commit/97486345c6396fe8132cc9e655d2a639d837641e","node_id":"C_kwDOT_kRC9oAKDk3NDg2MzQ1YzYzOTZmZTgxMzJjYzllNjU1ZDJhNjM5ZDgzNzY0MWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commit/16df3883a2f32cceeb8b9e3fdec231533042310b","sha":"16df3883a2f32cceeb8b9e3fdec231533042310b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commits/16df3883a2f32cceeb8b9e3fdec231533042310b"}],"sha":"97486345c6396fe8132cc9e655d2a639d837641e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commits/97486345c6396fe8132cc9e655d2a639d837641e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/615608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jmars","id":615608,"login":"jmars","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNTYwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commits/16df3883a2f32cceeb8b9e3fdec231533042310b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T02:36:05Z","email":"github@jaye.ch","name":"Jaye Marshall"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T02:36:05Z","email":"github@jaye.ch","name":"Jaye Marshall"},"message":"P1: fix review findings — transplant fallback on failed update (BUG-A) + update on prop change at stable ref (BUG-B)","tree":{"sha":"1849e028dd238e79c63438095815050746122c23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/git/trees/1849e028dd238e79c63438095815050746122c23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/git/commits/16df3883a2f32cceeb8b9e3fdec231533042310b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/615608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jmars","id":615608,"login":"jmars","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNTYwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commit/16df3883a2f32cceeb8b9e3fdec231533042310b","node_id":"C_kwDOT_kRC9oAKDE2ZGYzODgzYTJmMzJjY2VlYjhiOWUzZmRlYzIzMTUzMzA0MjMxMGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commit/8f2cddeefa79bb76179d195d7741e3b10c1a56e3","sha":"8f2cddeefa79bb76179d195d7741e3b10c1a56e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commits/8f2cddeefa79bb76179d195d7741e3b10c1a56e3"}],"sha":"16df3883a2f32cceeb8b9e3fdec231533042310b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commits/16df3883a2f32cceeb8b9e3fdec231533042310b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commits/8f2cddeefa79bb76179d195d7741e3b10c1a56e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T02:30:14Z","email":"user@babylon.lan","name":"rattan sandbox user"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T02:30:14Z","email":"user@babylon.lan","name":"rattan sandbox user"},"message":"P1: implement @mfe/core reconciliation kernel\n\nApp-agnostic reconciliation kernel as the reusable @mfe/core package:\n- types.ts: public MFE/HostInterface/Slot/MountContext contract\n- ref.ts: hardened structural ref (element-only sibling index + localName,\n  with data-ref/id escape hatch) replacing the unstable childNodes.indexOf\n- dom.ts: slot discovery + collect()\n- template.ts: loadTemplate() parsing via <template>, DOM-agnostic\n- registry.ts: createRegistry() per-instance replacement for the module-global\n  running map\n- reconcile.ts: diff kernel (NEW->mount / same ref->transplant live childNodes /\n  moved ref->update / gone->unmount), with injected loadModule/host/registry\n  and onError; no fetch/import hardcoded\n\nTests (node:test + happy-dom): ref stability under text-node insert, real\nreorder detection, escape hatches, collect, loadTemplate, registry, and the\nreconcile diff semantics (transplant vs update vs unmount/mount). typecheck +\nnpm test green.","tree":{"sha":"b16a58997e1276e2c3ece9181b4bd672b530db71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/git/trees/b16a58997e1276e2c3ece9181b4bd672b530db71"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/git/commits/8f2cddeefa79bb76179d195d7741e3b10c1a56e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commit/8f2cddeefa79bb76179d195d7741e3b10c1a56e3","node_id":"C_kwDOT_kRC9oAKDhmMmNkZGVlZmE3OWJiNzYxNzlkMTk1ZDc3NDFlM2IxMGMxYTU2ZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commit/9f63150f38427ee772653a7c782523b297245299","sha":"9f63150f38427ee772653a7c782523b297245299","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commits/9f63150f38427ee772653a7c782523b297245299"}],"sha":"8f2cddeefa79bb76179d195d7741e3b10c1a56e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fixpoint-linux/mfe-framework/commits/8f2cddeefa79bb76179d195d7741e3b10c1a56e3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/615608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jmars","id":615608,"login":"jmars","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNTYwOA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jmars/received_events","repos_url"