g{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nihaadk","id":6087113,"login":"nihaadk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwODcxMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nihaadk/angular-nest-microfrontend-remote-template/commits/55f3e507424a0e777a0c00b2bb625a0daa701a4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:58:46Z","email":"nihadkeric@gmail.com","name":"nihaadk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:58:46Z","email":"nihadkeric@gmail.com","name":"nihaadk"},"message":"fix: remove trailing ''.'' path argument from railway up calls\n\nPassing ''.'' explicitly as railway up''s PATH argument fails with\n''prefix not found'' (a Railway CLI quirk - omitting it and letting PATH\ndefault to cwd works fine). Under set -e this silently broke the script\nafter creating the BE service: ''railway add'' succeeded, the follow-up\n''railway up'' failed and exited the script before FE was ever touched -\nBE ends up existing but with zero deployments (''offline'').\n\nFound and fixed live: BE was stuck exactly like this in the shared\nMicroFrontend-Angular-NestJS project (REMOTE-2-BE, service existed, no\ndeployments). Deployed both services + domains + variables manually to\nfix that instance, then fixed the script for next time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6391d0fa0c160330adf22f62fe3d706ddec664bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nihaadk/angular-nest-microfrontend-remote-template/git/trees/6391d0fa0c160330adf22f62fe3d706ddec664bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nihaadk/angular-nest-microfrontend-remote-template/git/commits/55f3e507424a0e777a0c00b2bb625a0daa701a4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6087113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nihaadk","id":6087113,"login":"nihaadk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwODcxMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nihaadk/angular-nest-microfrontend-remote-template/commit/55f3e507424a0e777a0c00b2bb625a0daa701a4c","node_id":"C_kwDOT_oQtNoAKDU1ZjNlNTA3NDI0YTBlNzc3YTBjMDBiMmJiNjI1YTBkYWE3MDFhNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nihaadk/angular-nest-microfrontend-remote-template/commit/0b0cf8cd9c8bafff1d687c7f0538c972a8c86b2b","sha":"0b0cf8cd9c8bafff1d687c7f0538c972a8c86b2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nihaadk/angular-nest-microfrontend-remote-template/commits/0b0cf8cd9c8bafff1d687c7f0538c972a8c86b2b"}],"sha":"55f3e507424a0e777a0c00b2bb625a0daa701a4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nihaadk/angular-nest-microfrontend-remote-template/commits/55f3e507424a0e777a0c00b2bb625a0daa701a4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6087113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nihaadk","id":6087113,"login":"nihaadk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwODcxMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nihaadk/angular-nest-microfrontend-remote-template/commits/0b0cf8cd9c8bafff1d687c7f0538c972a8c86b2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:50:50Z","email":"nihadkeric@gmail.com","name":"nihaadk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:50:50Z","email":"nihadkeric@gmail.com","name":"nihaadk"},"message":"feat: separate app name prompt from project selection in railway-deploy.sh\n\nAfter picking/creating a project, now separately prompts for an app name\nthat drives the service names (<app>-FE/<app>-BE), independent of the\nproject name. Needed because an existing project may already host other\napps (e.g. a host shell''s own FE/BE) - reusing the project name for\nservice names would collide with or misname those. Creating a brand new\nproject still asks for the project name first, then the app name for its\nfirst service, as two distinct prompts.\n\nREADME.md + setup.sh''s final message updated to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ab908178cdc739e375a1d2817403a6897ec890f","url":"h