author":{"date":"2026-08-23T10:16:15Z","email":"nihadkeric@gmail.com","name":"nihaadk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-23T10:16:15Z","email":"nihadkeric@gmail.com","name":"nihaadk"},"message":"feat: add railway-deploy.sh to automate Railway setup\n\n- Uses ''railway up'' (uploads fe/ and be/ directly, no GitHub repo needed)\n  instead of a GitHub-repo-based flow - avoids the Root Directory /\n  Dockerfile Path mismatch bug hit twice this session, since each upload\n  is already scoped to the right directory.\n- Always creates a new, isolated Railway project per remote (per request -\n  not shared with the shell''s project).\n- Never passes --port to ''railway domain'' - an explicit target port broke\n  Railway''s routing for this template the first time it was deployed by\n  hand (502s), fixed by letting Railway auto-detect instead.\n- Reads the remote''s name from fe/federation.config.mjs (set by setup.sh),\n  so it can''t disagree with it. Idempotent: safe to re-run.\n- README.md + setup.sh''s final message updated to point at it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a57089e2f88ddc043fe5a56bcf67f5dff0f0b77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nihaadk/angular-nest-microfrontend-remote-template/git/trees/2a57089e2f88ddc043fe5a56bcf67f5dff0f0b77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nihaadk/angular-nest-microfrontend-remote-template/git/commits/72a6b9e03ea8067f67baa6f9bc66cc766777285b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6087113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nihaadk","id":6087113,"login":"nihaadk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwODcxMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nihaadk/angular-nest-microfrontend-remote-template/commit/72a6b9e03ea8067f67baa6f9bc66cc766777285b","node_id":"C_kwDOT_oQtNoAKDcyYTZiOWUwM2VhODA2N2Y2N2JhYTZmOWJjNjZjYzc2Njc3NzI4NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nihaadk/angular-nest-microfrontend-remote-template/commit/da903143bb3023d75ee04693a21de9b0b07b6544","sha":"da903143bb3023d75ee04693a21de9b0b07b6544","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nihaadk/angular-nest-microfrontend-remote-template/commits/da903143bb3023d75ee04693a21de9b0b07b6544"}],"sha":"72a6b9e03ea8067f67baa6f9bc66cc766777285b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nihaadk/angular-nest-microfrontend-remote-template/commits/72a6b9e03ea8067f67baa6f9bc66cc766777285b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6087113?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nihaadk","id":6087113,"login":"nihaadk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwODcxMTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nihaadk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nihaadk/angular-nest-microfrontend-remote-template/commits/da903143bb3023d75ee04693a21de9b0b07b6544/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T12:52:21Z","email":"nihadkeric@gmail.com","name":"nihaadk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T12:52:21Z","email":"nihadkeric@gmail.com","name":"nihaadk"},"message":"feat: prepare fe/be Dockerfiles for Railway (two separate services)\n\n- fe/Dockerfile + docker-entrypoint.sh: static build served via ''serve'',\n  regenerates env.json from BE_URL at container start (no rebuild needed\n  to point at a different backend). Serves with --cors since this is a\n  Native Federation remote - its JS has to be loadable cross-origin by\n  whatever host shell embeds it.\n- be/Dockerfile: standalone NestJS API image.\n- be/src/main.ts: CORS_ORIGINS now env-var driven (was hardcoded), binds\n  explicitly to 0.0.0.0 (the exact 502 cause we hit and fixed on shell/be),\n  loads a local .env via dotenv for local dev.\n- fe: added the runtime-env.ts/env.json pattern (mirrors shell/fe) so\n  example.service.ts no longer hardcodes its backend''s URL.\n- setup.sh: updated substitutions to match (env.json + .env.example\n  defaults instead of the now-removed hardcoded example.service.ts URL),\n  plus a note in the printed output that Dockerfiles are ready.\n- README: Deployment section now documents the two-service Railway setup\n  instead of saying Dockerfiles don''t exist yet.\n\nNot deployed - Dockerfiles and config only, per request.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"770c376b7b766498453bb884fc512739d063760a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nihaadk/angular-nest-microfrontend-remote-template/git/trees/770c376b7b766498453bb884fc512739d063760a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/