nerated message by the message\n\n*Message[T] carries Message[T]''s methods, so the interface check matched it\nfirst and called the descriptor on a nil pointer. Unwrap pointers before it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgcdDfnJkwhq+GcBoTN3TX56bX0H\n8InRU9/eZzzo1eEkwAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNbEpbiUXscRhoWJRZyVcs96a/GQHXtjUam7hVYYI99+Yku1no7LubfXBS9BNbB/je\nDZMuTc/lJ+sMDXFE3x7wA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-25T09:01:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/312536060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antoinetoussaint-byte","id":312536060,"login":"antoinetoussaint-byte","node_id":"U_kgDOEqDr_A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-go/commit/2007f853dcfbc2fca718ee1539f37d39093165db","node_id":"C_kwDOT_s2s9oAKDIwMDdmODUzZGNmYmMyZmNhNzE4ZWUxNTM5ZjM3ZDM5MDkzMTY1ZGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/codefly-dev/soluti