"user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-go/commits/c0b787251cf78190fad4cce012bff07671fc7c9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T18:20:45Z","email":"antoine.toussaint@obin.ai","name":"antoinetoussaint-byte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T18:20:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: bump codefly-dev/core to v0.3.24 (#20) (#21)\n\ncore v0.3.21 was retagged after publication, so the proxy and sumdb hold\nthe first content published under that version. Any consumer whose go.sum\nrecorded the other hash can never verify it again, and v0.0.6 propagated\nthat pin to every solution backend.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"78ad7e24e4203da5840c728e5b7a206045e6e3c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-go/git/trees/78ad7e24e4203da5840c728e5b7a206045e6e3c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-go/git/commits/c0b787251cf78190fad4cce012bff07671fc7c9c","verification":{"payload":"tree 78ad7e24e4203da5840c728e5b7a206045e6e3c0\nparent 039f035e0aec1edd71dfba86ddcd7fd3f69e6cf2\nauthor antoinetoussaint-byte <antoine.toussaint@obin.ai> 1788978045 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788978045 -0400\n\nchore: bump codefly-dev/core to v0.3.24 (#20) (#21)\n\ncore v0.3.21 was retagged after publication, so the proxy and sumdb hold\nthe first content published under that version. Any consumer whose go.sum\nrecorded the other hash can never verify it again, and v0.0.6 propagated\nthat pin to every solution backend.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoaN9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYJMQACB01Yt6ZJyFHj41sJSAny/r\nfSGj9pf9xfX1qM1oWGg/uKlsNnceP9irki6BvhQSTxfX3GLKwcZEnkM9o+bKoJLy\nLh1SoPbmzUdnYNZuSUwC/n8luXVPgPXK3iySFp2Wv0vza73fAZumXo7+SYDp5sVz\n8QuobtV99Smbde