E-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-25T16:27:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/commit/16ac080772f36095614f9efce8d032dddc06bc08","node_id":"C_kwDOT_s30NoAKDE2YWMwODA3NzJmMzYwOTU2MTRmOWVmY2U4ZDAzMmRkZGMwNmJjMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/commit/f8cc9fbfc7b640ec3df8121d113f9db360a2848a","sha":"f8cc9fbfc7b640ec3df8121d113f9db360a2848a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/commits/f8cc9fbfc7b640ec3df8121d113f9db360a2848a"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/commit/48eb1be351ffe4018d55061c3fab713e96c075dd","sha":"48eb1be351ffe4018d55061c3fab713e96c075dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/commits/48eb1be351ffe4018d55061c3fab713e96c075dd"}],"sha":"16ac080772f36095614f9efce8d032dddc06bc08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/commits/16ac080772f36095614f9efce8d032dddc06bc08"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/312536060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antoinetoussaint-byte","id":312536060,"login":"antoinetoussaint-byte","node_id":"U_kgDOEqDr_A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/commits/48eb1be351ffe4018d55061c3fab713e96c075dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T16:20:16Z","email":"antoine.toussaint@obin.ai","name":"Antoine Toussaint"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T16:20:16Z","email":"antoine.toussaint@obin.ai","name":"Antoine Toussaint"},"message":"fix: make solution-sdk sync produce a working SDK (#72)\n\nReview of the first cut found the sync driver did not actually produce a\nusable SDK. Fixes, highest severity first:\n\n- Bindings never reached the SDK. buf.gen.yaml used `out: .`, but codefly runs\n  buf from the proto dir, so pb2 landed in the discarded temp tree, not `out/`.\n  Generate into a scratch dir and vendor it into `out/`.\n- Documented import was broken. The facade uses absolute `import saas...`, which\n  resolves only with the vendored root on sys.path — README showed\n  `from _sdk.accounts import accounts`, which raised ModuleNotFoundError. README\n  now shows the working form.\n- rmtree footgun. sync deleted `out/` unconditionally on a user-controlled path;\n  `out: backend` would wipe real source. Confine `out` below the manifest dir and\n  only delete a directory carrying our SOURCE.txt.\n- Descriptor build skipped `buf dep update`, so it failed on BSR deps\n  (protovalidate, googleapis). Resolve deps after fetch.\n- Bindings were limited to the package dir, so a response type in an imported\n  package produced a facade importing a pb2 that was never generated. Generate\n  exactly the transitive local files the selected services reference.\n- A typo in `services:` silently produced no facade. Validate declared services\n  exist; the standalone plugin now also fails loud on service/method/accessor\n  name collisions and emits one file per package instead of merging.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9f5a3704ca89ddd8c0ae068ccd2260900121838","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/git/trees/d9f5a3704ca89ddd8c0ae068ccd2260900121838"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/git/commits/48eb1be351ffe4018d55061c3fab713e96c075dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/312536060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antoinetoussaint-byte","id":312536060,"login":"antoinetoussaint-byte","node_id":"U_kgDOEqDr_A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/commit/48eb1be351ffe4018d55061c3fab713e96c075dd","node_id":"C_kwDOT_s30NoAKDQ4ZWIxYmUzNTFmZmU0MDE4ZDU1MDYxYzNmYWI3MTNlOTZjMDc1ZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/commit/87ee505e9b4ea8f29b5ff0c6ae2e159d9c8c4cbc","sha":"87ee505e9b4ea8f29b5ff0c6ae2e159d9c8c4cbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/commits/87ee505e9b4ea8f29b5ff0c6ae2e159d9c8c4cbc"}],"sha":"48eb1be351ffe4018d55061c3fab713e96c075dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/commits/48eb1be351ffe4018d55061c3fab713e96c075dd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/312536060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antoinetoussaint-byte","id":312536060,"login":"antoinetoussaint-byte","node_id":"U_kgDOEqDr_A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/commits/87ee505e9b4ea8f29b5ff0c6ae2e159d9c8c4cbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T15:58:19Z","email":"antoine.toussaint@obin.ai","name":"Antoine Toussaint"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T15:58:19Z","email":"antoine.toussaint@obin.ai","name":"Antoine Toussaint"},"message":"feat: generate a vendored per-solution SDK from declared dependencies (#72)\n\nA solution declares the module dependencies it calls in solution-sdk.yaml;\n`solution-sdk sync` builds one SDK for that solution — message bindings via\n`codefly generate proto` plus a gateway-bound facade emitted from the proto\ndescriptor — and vendors it, carrying only the declared services.\n\nThe facade routes every call through the runtime''s Gateway.unary seam, so a\nhandler writes `accounts(gw).audit().query_audit_log(req)` instead of threading\na raw procedure string, and the runtime stays module-agnostic.\n\nCloses obin-ai/lodestar#72.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b041033fcdc1ddbc2f9a140cfefa0c6e4ec159aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/git/trees/b041033fcdc1ddbc2f9a140cfefa0c6e4ec159aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/git/commits/87ee505e9b4ea8f29b5ff0c6ae2e159d9c8c4cbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/312536060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/followers","foll