d_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/commits/0b709e6f367fb4d435be9ef3a49e962898c14b45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T16:03:37Z","email":"antoine.toussaint@obin.ai","name":"Antoine Toussaint"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T16:03:37Z","email":"antoine.toussaint@obin.ai","name":"Antoine Toussaint"},"message":"feat: send x-codefly-internal-token on registration heartbeats (#1)\n\nRead CODEFLY_INTERNAL_TOKEN from env and attach it as the\nx-codefly-internal-token header on both the host and gateway\nregistration heartbeats when set, so a solution can self-register\nagainst a v0.0.41+ solution seam. No-op when the token is unset.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9bfa0f131537ba402e587b2d15f9676a316c3d4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/git/trees/9bfa0f131537ba402e587b2d15f9676a316c3d4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codefly-dev/solution-runtime-python/git/commits/0b709e6f367fb4d435be9ef3a49e962898c14b45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/312536060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antoinetoussaint-byte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","