arred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akotkaryash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akotkaryash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akotkaryash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akotkaryash/developer-companion/commits/f705ef8a18bcddaf3d930070ea02a53a02ea5050/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:37:10Z","email":"yashakotkar@hotmail.com","name":"akotkaryash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:40:31Z","email":"yashakotkar@hotmail.com","name":"akotkaryash"},"message":"fix(ci): replace nonexistent docker/compose-github-action with native docker compose (#42)\n\nEvery CI run since it was added has failed in ~7s, before any real\nstep ran: docker/compose-github-action@v2 doesn''t exist as a GitHub\nAction (\"repository not found\"), so the workflow failed at the\n\"prepare required actions\" stage regardless of what code changed.\n\nubuntu-latest runners already ship Docker + the Compose v2 plugin, so\nno third-party action is needed - just run `docker compose config`\ndirectly. Verified locally: exits 0.\n\nAlso drops the obsolete `version: ''3.8''` field from docker-compose.yml\n(Compose v2 ignores it and warns on every run).","tree":{"sha":"3dd1473242ef9bab45c1619b8dfa03428382b9c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akotkaryash/developer-companion/git/trees/3dd1473242ef9bab45c1619b8dfa03428382b9c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akotkaryash/developer-companion/git/commits/f705ef8a18bcddaf3d930070ea02a53a02ea5050","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/284685226?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akotkaryash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akotkaryash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akotkaryash/following{/other_user}","gi