.com/users/akotkaryash/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akotkaryash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akotkaryash/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akotkaryash","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akotkaryash/developer-companion/commits/676b1195cccead16c1ad587e08d897bcaaa87409/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:31:30Z","email":"yashakotkar@hotmail.com","name":"akotkaryash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T14:40:31Z","email":"yashakotkar@hotmail.com","name":"akotkaryash"},"message":"docs: add Epic 13 (Android Companion Widget) to roadmap (#41)\n\nA true home-screen widget requires native Android APIs\n(AppWidgetProvider/Jetpack Glance) - not achievable from the Angular\nweb app - so this is a new epic rather than folded into Epic 7.\nScoped around closing the loop for someone who won''t reliably open a\nlaptop to check progress: streak status/urgency, one AI-recommended\nproblem for today, XP/level as a secondary glance.\n\nBuild scope (full companion app vs. widget-only) is intentionally left\nopen per issue #40, to be decided when this epic is actually picked\nup rather than now.","tree":{"sha":"4a56503bbecf3ae689c28f2292b78db5cdbd06ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akotkaryash/developer-companion/git/trees/4a56503bbecf3ae689c28f2292b78db5cdbd06ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/akotkaryash/developer-companion/git/commits/676b1195cccead16c1ad587e08d897bcaaa87409","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/284685226?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akotkaryash/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akotkaryash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akotkaryash/following{/other_user}","gists_url